(3672739, 516424, 69325, '<td valign="top">im gonna go ahead and give you a ten as i knew the moment i saw it, it was home page stuff</td>', 'im gonna go ahead and give you a ten as i knew the moment i saw it, it was home page stuff', '2007-05-21 03:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672741, 517082, 69325, '<td valign="top">KILLER concept and execution 10 and a fav!</td>', 'KILLER concept and execution 10 and a fav!', '2007-05-21 03:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672744, 515816, 69325, '<td valign="top">simply great! 10</td>', 'simply great! 10', '2007-05-21 03:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672746, 516783, 69325, '<td valign="top">ill give you a 6 for the cleavage</td>', 'ill give you a 6 for the cleavage', '2007-05-21 04:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672747, 516048, 6804, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  What did you do to make him so sad?  You should be ashamed of yourself. <br/>;P<br/> <br/>This has great detail, tone values and placement. I think it''s difficult to snap a picture of person and have it display such strong interest to a total stranger.  This is something I aspire to and you''ve acomplished with flying colors.  <br/> <br/>Speaking of colors..... I think the eyes might have worked better for me if they were ever so subtle.  The blue is just too deep and un-natural and really takes away from the mood of the shot.  <br/> <br/>When I see a de-saturation technique used in a photograph, I always ask myself... why was it used and does the end result look better than if the technique hadn''t been used at all.  I am using this thinking in my voting for this challenge.  This would have easily been a 10 in another challenge.  For this challenge it is still an impressive 8.  It''s a great capture.</td>', 'Excellent shot!  What did you do to make him so sad?  You should be ashamed of yourself. ;P This has great detail, tone values and placement. I think it''s difficult to snap a picture of person and have it display such strong interest to a total stranger.  This is something I aspire to and you''ve acomplished with flying colors.   Speaking of colors..... I think the eyes might have worked better for me if they were ever so subtle.  The blue is just too deep and un-natural and really takes away from the mood of the shot.   When I see a de-saturation technique used in a photograph, I always ask myself... why was it used and does the end result look better than if the technique hadn''t been used at all.  I am using this thinking in my voting for this challenge.  This would have easily been a 10 in another challenge.  For this challenge it is still an impressive 8.  It''s a great capture.', '2007-05-21 04:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672749, 515708, 69325, '<td valign="top">YAY! my fav part of every challenge is the gratuitous nudity /6</td>', 'YAY! my fav part of every challenge is the gratuitous nudity /6', '2007-05-21 04:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672752, 515285, 69325, '<td valign="top">something tells me its not soft....get a room!</td>', 'something tells me its not soft....get a room!', '2007-05-21 04:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672758, 514002, 49109, '<td valign="top">like the concept and the angle, but the way and amount you darkened the background looks wrong</td>', 'like the concept and the angle, but the way and amount you darkened the background looks wrong', '2007-05-21 04:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
