(3672786, 516341, 6804, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the de-saturate technique!!  I''m sure a thigh, a breast or a wing might have given you a couple extra tens this week.  A 9 from me,  It is a great Idea.</td>', 'Excellent use of the de-saturate technique!!  I''m sure a thigh, a breast or a wing might have given you a couple extra tens this week.  A 9 from me,  It is a great Idea.', '2007-05-21 04:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672790, 516390, 6804, '<td valign="top">Researchers found that 2,177,888 people suffered ladder injuries from 1990 to 2005.  With that, I wonder how you were able to get to those top branches with that little step stool.<br/> <br/>There is much to like about this one, It is a clever shot indeed.  9 from me.</td>', 'Researchers found that 2,177,888 people suffered ladder injuries from 1990 to 2005.  With that, I wonder how you were able to get to those top branches with that little step stool. There is much to like about this one, It is a clever shot indeed.  9 from me.', '2007-05-21 04:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672792, 515418, 6804, '<td valign="top">Excellent Accent!  10</td>', 'Excellent Accent!  10', '2007-05-21 04:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672806, 514788, 6804, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Artistic and an unsusal application for desaturation.  Very nice work!  This is my favorite of the challenge at this point.  This will be hard to beat.  11</td>', 'Wow!  Artistic and an unsusal application for desaturation.  Very nice work!  This is my favorite of the challenge at this point.  This will be hard to beat.  11', '2007-05-21 04:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
