(3672911, 515655, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Flower seems unnaturally vivid though. Still, I like the image.</td>', 'Nice capture. Flower seems unnaturally vivid though. Still, I like the image.', '2007-05-21 06:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672912, 515261, 30861, '<td valign="top">You found ART''s house!</td>', 'You found ART''s house!', '2007-05-21 06:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672913, 516973, 53316, '<td valign="top">I have only seen about a hundred images so far. But even so I think I can safely say, I really hope this ribbons.</td>', 'I have only seen about a hundred images so far. But even so I think I can safely say, I really hope this ribbons.', '2007-05-21 06:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672914, 511746, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good simple shot, well executed. It''s a nice use of desat without being over the top.</td>', 'Good simple shot, well executed. It''s a nice use of desat without being over the top.', '2007-05-21 06:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672917, 516399, 23430, '<td valign="top">The photo and concept is good but a bit over done for my taste.</td>', 'The photo and concept is good but a bit over done for my taste.', '2007-05-21 06:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672919, 516758, 46314, '<td valign="top">The title suggests playfulness, but the selective desat gives the photo a more creepy feel. The word ''carcass'' comes to mind, because of all those dark greys and blacks. Not sure you captured exactly what you were looking for here.</td>', 'The title suggests playfulness, but the selective desat gives the photo a more creepy feel. The word ''carcass'' comes to mind, because of all those dark greys and blacks. Not sure you captured exactly what you were looking for here.', '2007-05-21 06:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672920, 516585, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, but probably doomed. You have my vote anyway :-)</td>', 'Outstanding, but probably doomed. You have my vote anyway :-)', '2007-05-21 06:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672921, 515828, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.</td>', 'Nice tones.', '2007-05-21 06:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672922, 515348, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Maybe a longer shutter speed causing the cars to blur would have suggested a busier and more hectic ''rat race'' going on around you.</td>', 'Nice idea. Maybe a longer shutter speed causing the cars to blur would have suggested a busier and more hectic ''rat race'' going on around you.', '2007-05-21 06:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672923, 517082, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice out-of-the-box concept. unfortunately the view is not very interesting. blue sails are oversaturated. orange color on paint-roll makes no sense.</td>', 'nice out-of-the-box concept. unfortunately the view is not very interesting. blue sails are oversaturated. orange color on paint-roll makes no sense.', '2007-05-21 06:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672924, 515949, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. And I liked the subdued nature of the coloured part. Doesn''t make the bird seem unnatural.</td>', 'Nice capture. And I liked the subdued nature of the coloured part. Doesn''t make the bird seem unnatural.', '2007-05-21 06:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672925, 515823, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright and I like the wide angle. My only pick is that the background is a bit untidy.</td>', 'Nice and bright and I like the wide angle. My only pick is that the background is a bit untidy.', '2007-05-21 06:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672927, 516815, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hahah, awesome concept :-D</td>', 'Hahah, awesome concept :-D', '2007-05-21 06:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672928, 511516, 30861, '<td valign="top">That you, Stephen? I gotta love this one :-) It has an eerie feeling.</td>', 'That you, Stephen? I gotta love this one :-) It has an eerie feeling.', '2007-05-21 06:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672929, 516973, 46314, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea. Very well executed.</td>', 'Brilliant idea. Very well executed.', '2007-05-21 06:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672931, 516389, 46314, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem like any real reason for the selective desat. here. Might have been a more striking image in total greyscale.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem like any real reason for the selective desat. here. Might have been a more striking image in total greyscale.', '2007-05-21 06:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672932, 517079, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great use of desat. The background with it''s symmetry and shapes compliments the lovely colourful flowers in the centre.</td>', 'Great use of desat. The background with it''s symmetry and shapes compliments the lovely colourful flowers in the centre.', '2007-05-21 06:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672933, 512728, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Might have been a prettier image if it was all colour, but I guess, then it wouldn''t have qualified for this challenge...</td>', 'Nice colours. Might have been a prettier image if it was all colour, but I guess, then it wouldn''t have qualified for this challenge...', '2007-05-21 06:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672935, 515854, 30861, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT! There''s a REASON for this desat, it isn''t arbitrary. Wonderful action too. I wish you''d titled it "Towline", but what the hey.</td>', 'EXCELLENT! There''s a REASON for this desat, it isn''t arbitrary. Wonderful action too. I wish you''d titled it "Towline", but what the hey.', '2007-05-21 06:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672937, 515968, 23430, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea. Good composition too.</td>', 'What a cool idea. Good composition too.', '2007-05-21 06:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672938, 516219, 46314, '<td valign="top">Selection for the desat seems a bit rough around the edges - seems to distract from the sharpness of the rest of the flower.</td>', 'Selection for the desat seems a bit rough around the edges - seems to distract from the sharpness of the rest of the flower.', '2007-05-21 06:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672939, 515130, 46314, '<td valign="top">Like the dreamlike feel of the selection. Strong composition.</td>', 'Like the dreamlike feel of the selection. Strong composition.', '2007-05-21 06:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672941, 515131, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the set-up and composition. The selective desat. doesn''t seem to have a point to it though.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the set-up and composition. The selective desat. doesn''t seem to have a point to it though.', '2007-05-21 06:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672942, 515049, 30861, '<td valign="top">FINE piece of work!</td>', 'FINE piece of work!', '2007-05-21 06:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672944, 515864, 46314, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. I''d love to know where you shot it.</td>', 'Fascinating image. I''d love to know where you shot it.', '2007-05-21 06:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672945, 515542, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice</td>', 'Very, very nice', '2007-05-21 06:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672946, 514626, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am imagining you PAINTING that snail then letting him loose...</td>', 'I am imagining you PAINTING that snail then letting him loose...', '2007-05-21 06:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3672947, 516847, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject. The saturated area doesn''t overwhelm with colour, and it''s subtlety allows the attention to be focused on the detail of the flower.</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject. The saturated area doesn''t overwhelm with colour, and it''s subtlety allows the attention to be focused on the detail of the flower.', '2007-05-21 06:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
