(3674846, 514831, 47316, '<td valign="top">cute! I have a soft spot for fairies though so I might be biased. ;)<br/> <br/>Some improvements... I''m a fan of expression joyful laugh, funny face, excitement, etc. If you didn''t want to show her face maybe arms up like shes dancing or mid spin or something? As far as editing, if the dress matched I might have left that maybe with half saturation to break it up a little. I probably would have cropped out more of the top of the image, to me it looks better without the moss and I like that composition, but as always that a personal choice.<br/> <br/>Overal pretty and lighthearted imge.</td>', 'cute! I have a soft spot for fairies though so I might be biased. ;) Some improvements... I''m a fan of expression joyful laugh, funny face, excitement, etc. If you didn''t want to show her face maybe arms up like shes dancing or mid spin or something? As far as editing, if the dress matched I might have left that maybe with half saturation to break it up a little. I probably would have cropped out more of the top of the image, to me it looks better without the moss and I like that composition, but as always that a personal choice. Overal pretty and lighthearted imge.', '2007-05-21 14:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
