(3675896, 514911, 47316, '<td valign="top">sweet image. love the innocence conveyed here. I don''t think I really like having the other leaves in color though. I''d say maybe just her or perhaps even keep the leaves slightly saturated (40% maybe) with a slow fade off with the perspective. Just some suggestions. As a piece for your portfolio I''d probably like to see the selective desat scraped altogether.</td>', 'sweet image. love the innocence conveyed here. I don''t think I really like having the other leaves in color though. I''d say maybe just her or perhaps even keep the leaves slightly saturated (40% maybe) with a slow fade off with the perspective. Just some suggestions. As a piece for your portfolio I''d probably like to see the selective desat scraped altogether.', '2007-05-21 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675902, 516927, 31439, '<td valign="top">I think I understand what you were going for here, but I would recommend one of two things.  Either have her eyes open, with an intense stare at the camera, or make it seem that she''s feeling the wind on her face with a fan or something.  Just a couple thoughts.</td>', 'I think I understand what you were going for here, but I would recommend one of two things.  Either have her eyes open, with an intense stare at the camera, or make it seem that she''s feeling the wind on her face with a fan or something.  Just a couple thoughts.', '2007-05-21 17:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
