(3675941, 514502, 31439, '<td valign="top">Great selection.  I''m not sure that it would help or not, but I''d be curious to see what this would look like if only the reflection of the boat was in color, rather than both boat and reflection.  Still, well done. 8</td>', 'Great selection.  I''m not sure that it would help or not, but I''d be curious to see what this would look like if only the reflection of the boat was in color, rather than both boat and reflection.  Still, well done. 8', '2007-05-21 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675950, 515804, 31439, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  I can''t tell, but is there a streak from the corner of her mouth extending down the shawl to her shirt that is supposed to be desaturated?  It''s kind of hard for me to tell.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  I can''t tell, but is there a streak from the corner of her mouth extending down the shawl to her shirt that is supposed to be desaturated?  It''s kind of hard for me to tell.', '2007-05-21 17:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675960, 515936, 31439, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Well chosen.  I like this one simply because it doesn''t seem "forced".  It''s very natural.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Well chosen.  I like this one simply because it doesn''t seem "forced".  It''s very natural.', '2007-05-21 17:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675974, 516685, 40718, '<td valign="top">underexposed, otherwise a great idea. 5</td>', 'underexposed, otherwise a great idea. 5', '2007-05-21 17:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675976, 516579, 31439, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, great clarity.  I like your choice of color placement, but I wonder if there was any color in her sandals that you could highlight to even out the photo.  I''m kind of reaching there...just throwing some possibilities out there.  Great shot though.</td>', 'Nice photo, great clarity.  I like your choice of color placement, but I wonder if there was any color in her sandals that you could highlight to even out the photo.  I''m kind of reaching there...just throwing some possibilities out there.  Great shot though.', '2007-05-21 17:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675983, 516834, 40718, '<td valign="top">something with your desat method is off.  His arms are looking quite jaundiced.</td>', 'something with your desat method is off.  His arms are looking quite jaundiced.', '2007-05-21 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675984, 516911, 31439, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot...kind of reminds me of Steven King''s "IT".  The umbrella stands out very nicely here.</td>', 'This is a cool shot...kind of reminds me of Steven King''s "IT".  The umbrella stands out very nicely here.', '2007-05-21 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675994, 516815, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  I''m not sure I like the pattern of the sweat.  Doesn''t look as realistic as in the Gatorade commercials.  maybe mist his face before putting on the colored stuff? 6</td>', 'nice idea.  I''m not sure I like the pattern of the sweat.  Doesn''t look as realistic as in the Gatorade commercials.  maybe mist his face before putting on the colored stuff? 6', '2007-05-21 17:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3675996, 515775, 31439, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  Did you chose that particular gosling because it seems to be watching the camera, or was there other significance to this particular duck?</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  Did you chose that particular gosling because it seems to be watching the camera, or was there other significance to this particular duck?', '2007-05-21 17:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676002, 513920, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think you could use some rotation.  I do like the desat though. 6</td>', 'I think you could use some rotation.  I do like the desat though. 6', '2007-05-21 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676010, 515261, 58728, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAH!  Heehee!  I can''t stop giggling!</td>', 'HAHAHAH!  Heehee!  I can''t stop giggling!', '2007-05-21 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676014, 516912, 40718, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  perhaps blend the top right edge a bit more to give it less 3D texture. 8</td>', 'nicely done.  perhaps blend the top right edge a bit more to give it less 3D texture. 8', '2007-05-21 17:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676019, 516681, 31439, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I don''t quite understand the significance/connection between the red on the boy and the red on the trash bins.  You may want to focus on one or the other next time.  Interesting photo, but I''m just a little confused I guess.</td>', 'To be honest, I don''t quite understand the significance/connection between the red on the boy and the red on the trash bins.  You may want to focus on one or the other next time.  Interesting photo, but I''m just a little confused I guess.', '2007-05-21 17:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676024, 516516, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think a bit underexposed, but I like the effect of leaving the skin gray.  Pretty cool. 7</td>', 'I think a bit underexposed, but I like the effect of leaving the skin gray.  Pretty cool. 7', '2007-05-21 17:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676026, 516532, 40718, '<td valign="top">mmm, we don''t have flowers on ours yet.  I''m looking forward to it as we have two massive 16-20 foot bushes in our backyard.  I don''t think the bricks add the texture you want. 5</td>', 'mmm, we don''t have flowers on ours yet.  I''m looking forward to it as we have two massive 16-20 foot bushes in our backyard.  I don''t think the bricks add the texture you want. 5', '2007-05-21 17:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676034, 516121, 40718, '<td valign="top">are people hammering you because you did everything in real life instead of desat in processing?  A nice attempt.  I''ll give you 2 bonus points just because I bet you are having a bad day. 7</td>', 'are people hammering you because you did everything in real life instead of desat in processing?  A nice attempt.  I''ll give you 2 bonus points just because I bet you are having a bad day. 7', '2007-05-21 18:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676037, 513090, 35645, '<td valign="top">The transition between colored deer and B&amp;W background is very harsh and there seems to be some haloing going on. Otherwise, I like the pic, especially the way they are framed by the branches.</td>', 'The transition between colored deer and B&W background is very harsh and there seems to be some haloing going on. Otherwise, I like the pic, especially the way they are framed by the branches.', '2007-05-21 18:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676038, 515454, 40718, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  Rises above most of the flower shots I''ve seen so far. 8</td>', 'nicely done.  Rises above most of the flower shots I''ve seen so far. 8', '2007-05-21 18:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676042, 516758, 40718, '<td valign="top">makes me giggle. 7</td>', 'makes me giggle. 7', '2007-05-21 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676047, 516044, 40718, '<td valign="top">this should do well. 8</td>', 'this should do well. 8', '2007-05-21 18:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676048, 516355, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very creative and striking use of the selective desat. The skin tones seem a little odd, though... kind of like there''s too much shadow, or too much contrast. I''m not sure, it just seems a bit off to me.</td>', 'Very creative and striking use of the selective desat. The skin tones seem a little odd, though... kind of like there''s too much shadow, or too much contrast. I''m not sure, it just seems a bit off to me.', '2007-05-21 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676053, 517081, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Reminds me of an artisit''s watercolor. Very nice use of shallow DOF and beautiful composition.</td>', 'Very pretty. Reminds me of an artisit''s watercolor. Very nice use of shallow DOF and beautiful composition.', '2007-05-21 18:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676064, 516519, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like the emphasis on the flower, but the composition seems a little off. I think I would like it better if the flower were EITHER centered OR placed on one of the ''sweet spots'' (Rule of Thirds). As is, it seems to be rather carelessly dropped in place rather than thoughtfully composed.</td>', 'I like the emphasis on the flower, but the composition seems a little off. I think I would like it better if the flower were EITHER centered OR placed on one of the ''sweet spots'' (Rule of Thirds). As is, it seems to be rather carelessly dropped in place rather than thoughtfully composed.', '2007-05-21 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676069, 516862, 35645, '<td valign="top">A little ''in your face'' for me (I prefer more subtlety with nude photos, both with lighting and presentation). Good concept, though, and I like how you''ve retained the color and texture of the apple.</td>', 'A little ''in your face'' for me (I prefer more subtlety with nude photos, both with lighting and presentation). Good concept, though, and I like how you''ve retained the color and texture of the apple.', '2007-05-21 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676075, 516059, 35645, '<td valign="top">Quite pretty, but I feel that with the eye partially desaturated it is missing something. Love the angle though, and the way the wings kind of ''vanish'' both toward and away from you.</td>', 'Quite pretty, but I feel that with the eye partially desaturated it is missing something. Love the angle though, and the way the wings kind of ''vanish'' both toward and away from you.', '2007-05-21 18:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676080, 514734, 35645, '<td valign="top">Leaving the balloons in color is nice, but I feel like he has a balloon for his head since the orange on completely covers his.</td>', 'Leaving the balloons in color is nice, but I feel like he has a balloon for his head since the orange on completely covers his.', '2007-05-21 18:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676084, 515617, 35645, '<td valign="top">Kind of macabre, like something I''d expect to see at Halloween or in some gothic comic (excuse me - graphic novel). Quite interesting, though.</td>', 'Kind of macabre, like something I''d expect to see at Halloween or in some gothic comic (excuse me - graphic novel). Quite interesting, though.', '2007-05-21 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3676088, 515415, 62009, '<td valign="top">All the red on the bridge is good and should be the focus...but that little bit of red on the boat is really distracting to me.</td>', 'All the red on the bridge is good and should be the focus...but that little bit of red on the boat is really distracting to me.', '2007-05-21 18:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676091, 515200, 63269, '<td valign="top">unique and interesting - I find it interesting how you left the sign''s reflection also in color. Good contrasts, and nice shot.</td>', 'unique and interesting - I find it interesting how you left the sign''s reflection also in color. Good contrasts, and nice shot.', '2007-05-21 18:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676092, 516624, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I might suggest burning or darkening out that light-spot behind the girls, it''s a little distracting. But otherwise you have a nice shot. :)</td>', 'Beautiful! I might suggest burning or darkening out that light-spot behind the girls, it''s a little distracting. But otherwise you have a nice shot. :)', '2007-05-21 18:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676093, 514126, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very busy - does not seem to have a defined subject. Also, not sure I can see a ''point'' to the desat. I think a single spray of lilac might have worked better for this idea, as the profusion of flowers shown overwhelms the concept as defined by the title.</td>', 'Very busy - does not seem to have a defined subject. Also, not sure I can see a ''point'' to the desat. I think a single spray of lilac might have worked better for this idea, as the profusion of flowers shown overwhelms the concept as defined by the title.', '2007-05-21 18:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676099, 514131, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasts and the deep tones - good shot! When I first saw it, I almost wished it had a slightly different POV... but the leading lines you have are nice.</td>', 'I love the contrasts and the deep tones - good shot! When I first saw it, I almost wished it had a slightly different POV... but the leading lines you have are nice.', '2007-05-21 18:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676100, 514911, 35645, '<td valign="top">Lovely job on the desat. The crop feels a little ''tight'' to me on the right and the bottom, but not too bad. Love the expression and pose.</td>', 'Lovely job on the desat. The crop feels a little ''tight'' to me on the right and the bottom, but not too bad. Love the expression and pose.', '2007-05-21 18:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676104, 516157, 62009, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you have the doors in color, it doesn''t add anything for me.</td>', 'Not sure why you have the doors in color, it doesn''t add anything for me.', '2007-05-21 18:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676109, 515464, 78237, '<td valign="top">The blur to me looks like it is moving in the wrong direction.  This blur would work with the back of the car.</td>', 'The blur to me looks like it is moving in the wrong direction.  This blur would work with the back of the car.', '2007-05-21 18:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676113, 516590, 63269, '<td valign="top">It looks like your white-balance might be off a bit. There''s nothing truely white in the shot... highlights that might be white area actually gray. I''ve had this problem too, and have discovered I can usually fix it by adjusting the levels in Photoshop. Excellent try though, and very cool idea! :)</td>', 'It looks like your white-balance might be off a bit. There''s nothing truely white in the shot... highlights that might be white area actually gray. I''ve had this problem too, and have discovered I can usually fix it by adjusting the levels in Photoshop. Excellent try though, and very cool idea! :)', '2007-05-21 18:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676117, 511697, 62009, '<td valign="top">The title is "Kiss" but I had to look and look to find a kiss.  The red is overpowering and the people should probably be in color.</td>', 'The title is "Kiss" but I had to look and look to find a kiss.  The red is overpowering and the people should probably be in color.', '2007-05-21 18:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676118, 515866, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it! The lighting is so unique, and I love the little touch of green in the bubbles over the tree.  Good composition too.</td>', 'I love it! The lighting is so unique, and I love the little touch of green in the bubbles over the tree.  Good composition too.', '2007-05-21 18:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676121, 516635, 35645, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I ''get'' this photo. Her expression and pose do not signify ''hate'' or even mild anger to me. Rather, she looks bored. The lighting is quite harsh, and the background somewhat intrusive. A diffuser between the girl and the sun would soften the light, and a change in background (or using a shallower depth of field) would help with the background.</td>', 'I''m not sure I ''get'' this photo. Her expression and pose do not signify ''hate'' or even mild anger to me. Rather, she looks bored. The lighting is quite harsh, and the background somewhat intrusive. A diffuser between the girl and the sun would soften the light, and a change in background (or using a shallower depth of field) would help with the background.', '2007-05-21 18:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676124, 517077, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key effect here... how everything is white-ish. But either it''s slightly out of focus or some of the details have somehow been lost. Good try though!</td>', 'I like the high-key effect here... how everything is white-ish. But either it''s slightly out of focus or some of the details have somehow been lost. Good try though!', '2007-05-21 18:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676125, 512282, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good capture! :)</td>', 'Good capture! :)', '2007-05-21 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676127, 512896, 35645, '<td valign="top">The concept of this is wonderful, and I think the desat really works well here. What bothers me, though, is that the background is so very grainy, while she is not. It throws the pic off for me.</td>', 'The concept of this is wonderful, and I think the desat really works well here. What bothers me, though, is that the background is so very grainy, while she is not. It throws the pic off for me.', '2007-05-21 18:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676131, 516112, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Reminds me of another photo in the first selective desaturation challenge... :)   Great textures and colors.</td>', 'Very cool! Reminds me of another photo in the first selective desaturation challenge... :)   Great textures and colors.', '2007-05-21 18:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676133, 516541, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very good point of view!</td>', 'Very good point of view!', '2007-05-21 18:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676134, 516604, 35645, '<td valign="top">Good subject for desat, but you seem to have a little haloing around his comb, and the crop could stand to be a little tighter on the right and at the top.The crispness of the feathers is very nice, though, as is the OOF background.</td>', 'Good subject for desat, but you seem to have a little haloing around his comb, and the crop could stand to be a little tighter on the right and at the top.The crispness of the feathers is very nice, though, as is the OOF background.', '2007-05-21 18:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676136, 516178, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! It would be cool if the biker was in a little better focus, although the motion blur does give a feeling of motion.  Neat composition, and awesome contrasts here! I might suggest straightening the horizon out, but this is pretty cool.</td>', 'Cool! It would be cool if the biker was in a little better focus, although the motion blur does give a feeling of motion.  Neat composition, and awesome contrasts here! I might suggest straightening the horizon out, but this is pretty cool.', '2007-05-21 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676142, 516680, 35645, '<td valign="top">Don''t really care for the crop of this, and the desat is imperfect, especially around the eyes and the hair on the right.</td>', 'Don''t really care for the crop of this, and the desat is imperfect, especially around the eyes and the hair on the right.', '2007-05-21 18:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676143, 517025, 40718, '<td valign="top">heart palpitating...must...look...away.  Holy crap. ;)  She is a tall drink of water.  Oh, the picture is very nice too. 9  Favorite in the early running.</td>', 'heart palpitating...must...look...away.  Holy crap. ;)  She is a tall drink of water.  Oh, the picture is very nice too. 9  Favorite in the early running.', '2007-05-21 18:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676149, 513695, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very awesome!! Wonderful idea, and good execution. I love your composition.</td>', 'Very awesome!! Wonderful idea, and good execution. I love your composition.', '2007-05-21 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676155, 515803, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice desat, but as this is an advanced editing challenge, I would have cloned out the specks on the left. Nice composition and choice of subject for the challenge, though.</td>', 'Nice desat, but as this is an advanced editing challenge, I would have cloned out the specks on the left. Nice composition and choice of subject for the challenge, though.', '2007-05-21 18:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676156, 514002, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool - I like how you tilted the picture, it added a lot of interest to the composition! I might suggest adding a little contrast, but otherwise this is a pretty good shot.</td>', 'Cool - I like how you tilted the picture, it added a lot of interest to the composition! I might suggest adding a little contrast, but otherwise this is a pretty good shot.', '2007-05-21 18:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676157, 516687, 19095, '<td valign="top">Very good use of Selective Desat, especially like the couple walking.</td>', 'Very good use of Selective Desat, especially like the couple walking.', '2007-05-21 18:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676160, 515448, 63269, '<td valign="top">yumm! Interesting idea... must have taken a while to do each sprinkle like that!</td>', 'yumm! Interesting idea... must have taken a while to do each sprinkle like that!', '2007-05-21 18:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676162, 515953, 76941, '<td valign="top">Finally a flower pic with a different take. Would have been nice to see more of the drops colored.</td>', 'Finally a flower pic with a different take. Would have been nice to see more of the drops colored.', '2007-05-21 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676163, 515644, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and contrasts - excellent job.</td>', 'I love the tones and contrasts - excellent job.', '2007-05-21 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676165, 516698, 35645, '<td valign="top">He looks as though the light is bright enough to be painful! Perhaps a better shot (expression-wise) could have been obtained by putting him on the shade side of the house.</td>', 'He looks as though the light is bright enough to be painful! Perhaps a better shot (expression-wise) could have been obtained by putting him on the shade side of the house.', '2007-05-21 18:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676166, 516635, 19095, '<td valign="top">I don''t like how the face is underexposed and the hand overexposed and in my opinion the words should have been hand-written.  The idea is good though.</td>', 'I don''t like how the face is underexposed and the hand overexposed and in my opinion the words should have been hand-written.  The idea is good though.', '2007-05-21 18:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676169, 515676, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and beautiful tones in the B&amp;W portion. Love the contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and beautiful tones in the B&W portion. Love the contrast.', '2007-05-21 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676174, 516856, 35645, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems quite harsh (on camera flash, perhaps), but otherwise a lovely shot.</td>', 'The lighting seems quite harsh (on camera flash, perhaps), but otherwise a lovely shot.', '2007-05-21 18:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676175, 516515, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well... the subject you have chosen doesn''t really seem all that interesting. It''s just a rope... :( The composition is also kind of cluttered and confusing. I''m sorry. But other than that, you''ve done a pretty good job! Keep it up! :)</td>', 'Well... the subject you have chosen doesn''t really seem all that interesting. It''s just a rope... :( The composition is also kind of cluttered and confusing. I''m sorry. But other than that, you''ve done a pretty good job! Keep it up! :)', '2007-05-21 18:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676177, 513362, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting!</td>', 'Nice lighting!', '2007-05-21 18:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676179, 514756, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the concept, fits very well with the challenge, does not seem to be gratuitous desaturation, and the children are just perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the concept, fits very well with the challenge, does not seem to be gratuitous desaturation, and the children are just perfect.', '2007-05-21 18:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676182, 516601, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I LOVE the rich colors, clear details, and strong composition. Very glorious!</td>', 'Beautiful! I LOVE the rich colors, clear details, and strong composition. Very glorious!', '2007-05-21 18:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676184, 516070, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I like how subtle the pink is.</td>', 'Excellent! I like how subtle the pink is.', '2007-05-21 18:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676185, 515823, 35645, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, makes me want to test drive the car!</td>', 'Lovely composition, makes me want to test drive the car!', '2007-05-21 18:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676188, 511919, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful - I love the deep shadows in the background, and the way that the color fades into the black and white is a really neat touch!</td>', 'Beuatiful - I love the deep shadows in the background, and the way that the color fades into the black and white is a really neat touch!', '2007-05-21 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676189, 515964, 35645, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see anythign technically ''wrong'' with it, it just doesn''t really appeal to me. Sorry.</td>', 'I don''t really see anythign technically ''wrong'' with it, it just doesn''t really appeal to me. Sorry.', '2007-05-21 18:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676194, 516017, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! Awesome composition, and really neat subject!!</td>', 'Cool! Awesome composition, and really neat subject!!', '2007-05-21 18:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676195, 516653, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Would have liked the church to be a little more in focus.</td>', 'Interesting. Would have liked the church to be a little more in focus.', '2007-05-21 18:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676196, 514295, 19095, '<td valign="top">The selective desat actually enhances the picture - great work.</td>', 'The selective desat actually enhances the picture - great work.', '2007-05-21 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676197, 514261, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent point of view! It looks a little washed out however, I might suggest adding a little contrast. GOod shot.</td>', 'Excellent point of view! It looks a little washed out however, I might suggest adding a little contrast. GOod shot.', '2007-05-21 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676199, 516707, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! I would suggest adding a little contrast, and changing the composition. PLacing the subject in the center isn''t a really good idea... :)but otherwise, good job!</td>', 'Neat idea! I would suggest adding a little contrast, and changing the composition. PLacing the subject in the center isn''t a really good idea... :)but otherwise, good job!', '2007-05-21 18:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676200, 515748, 19095, '<td valign="top">Way to strong colors and to many - in my opinion.</td>', 'Way to strong colors and to many - in my opinion.', '2007-05-21 18:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676201, 514502, 35645, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is a really excellent example of how to make a subject stand out from a crowd. The shot is perhaps a little high key for my taste, but it is an excellent shot nonetheless. 9.</td>', 'Wow. This is a really excellent example of how to make a subject stand out from a crowd. The shot is perhaps a little high key for my taste, but it is an excellent shot nonetheless. 9.', '2007-05-21 18:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
