(3676646, 516651, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very intimate.<br/>Perspective doesn''t quite work for me, not sure why though.<br/>I do like it though.</td>', 'Very intimate.Perspective doesn''t quite work for me, not sure why though.I do like it though.', '2007-05-21 20:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676651, 516214, 29011, '<td valign="top">No you didn''t! :) it''s a great idea and you did. Would''ve liked to see the lips desaturated too.</td>', 'No you didn''t! :) it''s a great idea and you did. Would''ve liked to see the lips desaturated too.', '2007-05-21 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676665, 516636, 1748, '<td valign="top">like this alot !!!</td>', 'like this alot !!!', '2007-05-21 20:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676672, 515801, 55956, '<td valign="top">ahahaha very interesting solution, for the photo and for the water-melon :)</td>', 'ahahaha very interesting solution, for the photo and for the water-melon :)', '2007-05-21 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676675, 514327, 76941, '<td valign="top">Of the many, many, many flowers in this challange this is one of the more interesting ones, so good job for that. However it looks like you might have used the erase tool to do your colorations, which is fine but the upper edges of the flower aren''t as precise as they could be. I can see some of the green of the cactus. Also, I personally don''t understand the dots of color on the "stem". Could be quite nice with some re-editing.</td>', 'Of the many, many, many flowers in this challange this is one of the more interesting ones, so good job for that. However it looks like you might have used the erase tool to do your colorations, which is fine but the upper edges of the flower aren''t as precise as they could be. I can see some of the green of the cactus. Also, I personally don''t understand the dots of color on the "stem". Could be quite nice with some re-editing.', '2007-05-21 20:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676683, 515271, 28172, '<td valign="top">I love this. 9</td>', 'I love this. 9', '2007-05-21 20:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676687, 514673, 29011, '<td valign="top">Lovely edit but for the title would''ve liked to see the horse in color too.</td>', 'Lovely edit but for the title would''ve liked to see the horse in color too.', '2007-05-21 20:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676689, 516522, 55956, '<td valign="top">I think that the image is good but the whites are a bit burned and the duotone isn''t grayscale.</td>', 'I think that the image is good but the whites are a bit burned and the duotone isn''t grayscale.', '2007-05-21 20:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676691, 516446, 55956, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2007-05-21 20:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676695, 516305, 76941, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot. I do wish that I didn''t see the little bits of lawn peeking through the bauquet. This is also one of many shots of flowers with one of the blooms colored.</td>', 'Not a bad shot. I do wish that I didn''t see the little bits of lawn peeking through the bauquet. This is also one of many shots of flowers with one of the blooms colored.', '2007-05-21 20:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676697, 515653, 55956, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2007-05-21 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676703, 517075, 43281, '<td valign="top">i found this to be really clever and making great use of the desat</td>', 'i found this to be really clever and making great use of the desat', '2007-05-21 20:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676706, 516701, 28172, '<td valign="top">Lovely focus on the eyes!</td>', 'Lovely focus on the eyes!', '2007-05-21 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676712, 516504, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.</td>', 'Interesting photo.', '2007-05-21 20:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676714, 513124, 35645, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. I have to wonder if a different pose (to expose the complete tatt) wouldn''t have worked better, though.</td>', 'Good lighting. I have to wonder if a different pose (to expose the complete tatt) wouldn''t have worked better, though.', '2007-05-21 20:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676717, 515678, 55956, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2007-05-21 20:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676718, 515968, 70181, '<td valign="top">Such a creative shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'Such a creative shot.  Very nice.', '2007-05-21 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676720, 516603, 35645, '<td valign="top">Great concept and great shot. There''s some spots that didn''t quite get desaturated, though, that a little more attention (or perhaps a different desat technique) could have taken care of.</td>', 'Great concept and great shot. There''s some spots that didn''t quite get desaturated, though, that a little more attention (or perhaps a different desat technique) could have taken care of.', '2007-05-21 20:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676725, 516389, 70181, '<td valign="top">The line of the bridge running straight through the middle, the dull white sky...unfortunately there''s not much that interesting about the shot.  Reshoot on a day with some cloud texture in the sky, move the bridge up or down, add a little contrast to the trees and you''ll have a photo with a little more pop.</td>', 'The line of the bridge running straight through the middle, the dull white sky...unfortunately there''s not much that interesting about the shot.  Reshoot on a day with some cloud texture in the sky, move the bridge up or down, add a little contrast to the trees and you''ll have a photo with a little more pop.', '2007-05-21 20:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676731, 515924, 76941, '<td valign="top">One of the better flower shots.</td>', 'One of the better flower shots.', '2007-05-21 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676732, 513636, 35645, '<td valign="top">I have to assume that the title is referring to the building in front of which the bikes are parked, but I don''t get the point of the pic as it relates to the title, and I''m not seeing the connection to the items that are still in color.</td>', 'I have to assume that the title is referring to the building in front of which the bikes are parked, but I don''t get the point of the pic as it relates to the title, and I''m not seeing the connection to the items that are still in color.', '2007-05-21 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676736, 516770, 45764, '<td valign="top">Well taken picture, but what does the desat add to the picture?</td>', 'Well taken picture, but what does the desat add to the picture?', '2007-05-21 20:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676741, 513187, 45764, '<td valign="top">Maybe you did your desat to well, but it does not even apear to be one in the picture.</td>', 'Maybe you did your desat to well, but it does not even apear to be one in the picture.', '2007-05-21 20:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676742, 515801, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not to be rude, but this is a so-so picture. The angle isn''t very flattering, the light is very harsh, the divided background is pretty distracting, and you''ve got some pretty serious halos around your subject. That being said, I applaud the choice of items to desaturate - between the color and the title, you''ve brought attention not only to your concept, but to the idea behind the concept. (That is to say, it isn''t a meaningless desaturation, or desat for the sake of desat.) This shows me that you''ve put some thought into the shot, you just might want to work on the execution a bit. :)</td>', 'Not to be rude, but this is a so-so picture. The angle isn''t very flattering, the light is very harsh, the divided background is pretty distracting, and you''ve got some pretty serious halos around your subject. That being said, I applaud the choice of items to desaturate - between the color and the title, you''ve brought attention not only to your concept, but to the idea behind the concept. (That is to say, it isn''t a meaningless desaturation, or desat for the sake of desat.) This shows me that you''ve put some thought into the shot, you just might want to work on the execution a bit. :)', '2007-05-21 20:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676749, 517056, 58590, '<td valign="top">whatever is in the bottom left corner is distracting to the car, but i like the color and the crop.</td>', 'whatever is in the bottom left corner is distracting to the car, but i like the color and the crop.', '2007-05-21 20:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676750, 513385, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the title, and the pose/composition is excellent. The fish seems a little grainy (compared to the rest of the pic) and oversaturated, but otherwise an excellent shot.</td>', 'Love the title, and the pose/composition is excellent. The fish seems a little grainy (compared to the rest of the pic) and oversaturated, but otherwise an excellent shot.', '2007-05-21 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676760, 515304, 35645, '<td valign="top">The cherries are beautiful, but I wonder about the choice of location on the body... seems a bit strange to me to place them at the ear (and to hold the ear in such an unnatural way) when there are much more interesting places for cherries... :)</td>', 'The cherries are beautiful, but I wonder about the choice of location on the body... seems a bit strange to me to place them at the ear (and to hold the ear in such an unnatural way) when there are much more interesting places for cherries... :)', '2007-05-21 21:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676766, 514948, 28172, '<td valign="top">I love it. 10</td>', 'I love it. 10', '2007-05-21 21:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676767, 516006, 35645, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps a different angle would have worked much better. I had to really look before I quite figured out what this is - the angle given makes everything blend together in the busy-ness of bows, fender, mirrors, lights, and handles.</td>', 'I think perhaps a different angle would have worked much better. I had to really look before I quite figured out what this is - the angle given makes everything blend together in the busy-ness of bows, fender, mirrors, lights, and handles.', '2007-05-21 21:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676770, 513362, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful treatment of an all-too-common pest, um, weed, um, that is, ... flower. :) Lovely texture to the petals and very realistic color. This would have been all-too-easy to oversaturate. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful treatment of an all-too-common pest, um, weed, um, that is, ... flower. :) Lovely texture to the petals and very realistic color. This would have been all-too-easy to oversaturate. Good job.', '2007-05-21 21:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676774, 512513, 76941, '<td valign="top">Sweet image, great creative idea! Only thing...the color of the smoke seems weirdly cut off, it think it would have been just effective if you had just colored the sparks and left the smoke. But still a great photo 8.</td>', 'Sweet image, great creative idea! Only thing...the color of the smoke seems weirdly cut off, it think it would have been just effective if you had just colored the sparks and left the smoke. But still a great photo 8.', '2007-05-21 21:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676776, 516424, 35645, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Beautiful pose, wonderful, perfect expression, natural looking eyes, and the happy surprise of the candy lips! Not overdone at all, as it so easily could have been.</td>', 'Lovely image. Beautiful pose, wonderful, perfect expression, natural looking eyes, and the happy surprise of the candy lips! Not overdone at all, as it so easily could have been.', '2007-05-21 21:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676782, 516446, 28172, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2007-05-21 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676789, 515957, 35645, '<td valign="top">I thought at first that I didn''t care for this, and that the title made little sense. However, the longer I looked, the more it made sense, and the better I liked it. The little pocket of peace under the trees doesn''t reach out and ''wow'', but it certainly makes the picture. The only nit-picky thing I can say is that the horizon seems very slightly off (a degree, maybe two) in the verticality of the buildings. 8.</td>', 'I thought at first that I didn''t care for this, and that the title made little sense. However, the longer I looked, the more it made sense, and the better I liked it. The little pocket of peace under the trees doesn''t reach out and ''wow'', but it certainly makes the picture. The only nit-picky thing I can say is that the horizon seems very slightly off (a degree, maybe two) in the verticality of the buildings. 8.', '2007-05-21 21:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676793, 516834, 58590, '<td valign="top">the color appears more orange than red...</td>', 'the color appears more orange than red...', '2007-05-21 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676794, 516685, 35645, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective, and wonderful colors that really ''pop'' out and grab you. Gorgeous clouds.</td>', 'Lovely perspective, and wonderful colors that really ''pop'' out and grab you. Gorgeous clouds.', '2007-05-21 21:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676802, 513757, 58590, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and delicate</td>', 'Very beautiful and delicate', '2007-05-21 21:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676805, 516447, 35645, '<td valign="top">Aside from fitting the photo in the challenge, I don''t really see the point of desat here. It''s a lovely leaf, to be sure, but I would think it would stand out just as well even without desaturating the background.</td>', 'Aside from fitting the photo in the challenge, I don''t really see the point of desat here. It''s a lovely leaf, to be sure, but I would think it would stand out just as well even without desaturating the background.', '2007-05-21 21:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676817, 513367, 29009, '<td valign="top">Classic - I love it!  Nice job with the juxtaposition.</td>', 'Classic - I love it!  Nice job with the juxtaposition.', '2007-05-21 21:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3676825, 513748, 45764, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice image.</td>', 'Great idea, nice image.', '2007-05-21 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
