(3678952, 515182, 70514, '<td valign="top">I originally tried an image that was similar to this.  Problem was what I wanted in grayscale already looked in grayscale. Left the image not looking desaturated, which is what I''m seeing here.  I really like the idea, the texture is great.  But it gives an illusion of not being selectively desaturated, only my opinion.</td>', 'I originally tried an image that was similar to this.  Problem was what I wanted in grayscale already looked in grayscale. Left the image not looking desaturated, which is what I''m seeing here.  I really like the idea, the texture is great.  But it gives an illusion of not being selectively desaturated, only my opinion.', '2007-05-22 10:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
