(3678964, 516477, 70514, '<td valign="top">I think this image would''ve been terrific had the flower not been there.  The grass/weeds poking through the tire really gives it that feeling that the tire is old and forgotten.  The flower is distracting that vintage feel, for me.</td>', 'I think this image would''ve been terrific had the flower not been there.  The grass/weeds poking through the tire really gives it that feeling that the tire is old and forgotten.  The flower is distracting that vintage feel, for me.', '2007-05-22 10:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
