(3679029, 516685, 34192, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - perfect color choice.  This monitor sucks - could be a hair brighter - either the monitor or the image.  non-the-less - excellent work - Good luck!  9</td>', 'Beautiful image - perfect color choice.  This monitor sucks - could be a hair brighter - either the monitor or the image.  non-the-less - excellent work - Good luck!  9', '2007-05-22 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
