(3679076, 516910, 25024, '<td valign="top">Brave attempt, but it looks too soft, either your lens or a focus problem I think, and I''m not sure if you intended to desat its antenna but that also detracts. Sorry, I hope I haven''t offended but I am trying to be constructive.</td>', 'Brave attempt, but it looks too soft, either your lens or a focus problem I think, and I''m not sure if you intended to desat its antenna but that also detracts. Sorry, I hope I haven''t offended but I am trying to be constructive.', '2007-05-22 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679078, 516715, 70514, '<td valign="top">This is why I''m scared of goats!  LOL! This is great, and they have such freaky eyes, works very well here.</td>', 'This is why I''m scared of goats!  LOL! This is great, and they have such freaky eyes, works very well here.', '2007-05-22 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679080, 514171, 17148, '<td valign="top">Great blue eyes...wonderful image and great work on the B&amp;W. I don''t know why but the spot right next to its whiskers stands out too much. They could have been an easy remove. Very well done on the shot. 8</td>', 'Great blue eyes...wonderful image and great work on the B&W. I don''t know why but the spot right next to its whiskers stands out too much. They could have been an easy remove. Very well done on the shot. 8', '2007-05-22 10:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679083, 514037, 17148, '<td valign="top">Great faces...good B&amp;W and like the selection for color.</td>', 'Great faces...good B&W and like the selection for color.', '2007-05-22 10:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679086, 516176, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good focus and colours, subject appeal is low but, a good macro</td>', 'Good focus and colours, subject appeal is low but, a good macro', '2007-05-22 10:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679087, 516653, 17148, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft all over the image. I do like the exposure you got here...and like the selection.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft all over the image. I do like the exposure you got here...and like the selection.', '2007-05-22 10:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679089, 516355, 78115, '<td valign="top">nice ,very selective. should be top three</td>', 'nice ,very selective. should be top three', '2007-05-22 10:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679096, 517088, 17148, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot...really like the color here. I think the B&amp;W should pop more though...needs more contrast. Like your idea.</td>', 'Very interesting shot...really like the color here. I think the B&W should pop more though...needs more contrast. Like your idea.', '2007-05-22 10:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679097, 514217, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition in this.</td>', 'I like the angle and composition in this.', '2007-05-22 10:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679100, 515678, 70514, '<td valign="top">Oh how I love Chicago!  It''s great how you used the reflection to show how much it really is desaturated.  Great image!</td>', 'Oh how I love Chicago!  It''s great how you used the reflection to show how much it really is desaturated.  Great image!', '2007-05-22 10:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679106, 516636, 70514, '<td valign="top">I just love these old random "buildings".  Great texture and composition.</td>', 'I just love these old random "buildings".  Great texture and composition.', '2007-05-22 10:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679109, 515475, 17148, '<td valign="top">Like the B&amp;W on the balloon.</td>', 'Like the B&W on the balloon.', '2007-05-22 10:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679113, 511697, 17148, '<td valign="top">This works very well. Very different. Love the red.</td>', 'This works very well. Very different. Love the red.', '2007-05-22 10:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679120, 516087, 17148, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast.</td>', 'Not enough contrast.', '2007-05-22 11:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679125, 515967, 25024, '<td valign="top">Well thought out, good concept but I think you could have made a lot more impact with it. The desat works well but I''m not sure what the fag and ashtray adds, and I think I would have turned the picture away and shot it with the picture as the dominant part of the image and the model in a similar pose. If all that makes sense perhaps you could explain to me what I''m on about! Please take my remarks as the constructive criticism they are intended as. Good luck</td>', 'Well thought out, good concept but I think you could have made a lot more impact with it. The desat works well but I''m not sure what the fag and ashtray adds, and I think I would have turned the picture away and shot it with the picture as the dominant part of the image and the model in a similar pose. If all that makes sense perhaps you could explain to me what I''m on about! Please take my remarks as the constructive criticism they are intended as. Good luck', '2007-05-22 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
