(3679584, 515876, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good idea! It almost looks a little grainy, or as if the image isn''t very high-quality or something. Maybe over-sharpening? I''m not sure.  But other than that, cool shot!</td>', 'Good idea! It almost looks a little grainy, or as if the image isn''t very high-quality or something. Maybe over-sharpening? I''m not sure.  But other than that, cool shot!', '2007-05-22 13:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679587, 517079, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love this! The rich colors against the pure black is so lovely, and your simple composition is wonderful!! Excellent use of selective desaturation.  8  :)</td>', 'I love this! The rich colors against the pure black is so lovely, and your simple composition is wonderful!! Excellent use of selective desaturation.  8  :)', '2007-05-22 13:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679594, 516118, 63269, '<td valign="top">It''s a little confusing, there seem to be two people, but I can''t tell for sure... but I really love the deep contrasts and vibrant color - excellent job!</td>', 'It''s a little confusing, there seem to be two people, but I can''t tell for sure... but I really love the deep contrasts and vibrant color - excellent job!', '2007-05-22 13:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679595, 516546, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I''m not sure I like how the person seems to have a blue-ish tint... but I really like your composition and the clean white background works well here!</td>', 'Interesting. I''m not sure I like how the person seems to have a blue-ish tint... but I really like your composition and the clean white background works well here!', '2007-05-22 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679602, 516179, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and colors... it might be nice if the subject was looking at the camera. It''s like I almost wish the second lady was in color instead, since she seems to be more a part of the photo. But otherwise this is great! ;)</td>', 'I love the tones and colors... it might be nice if the subject was looking at the camera. It''s like I almost wish the second lady was in color instead, since she seems to be more a part of the photo. But otherwise this is great! ;)', '2007-05-22 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679606, 516532, 63269, '<td valign="top">Good job - it must have taken a while to out-line each purple blosom! I might suggest adding a little contrast, but otherwise, good shot.</td>', 'Good job - it must have taken a while to out-line each purple blosom! I might suggest adding a little contrast, but otherwise, good shot.', '2007-05-22 13:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679610, 515453, 63269, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! I love the deep contrasts - this is stunning! :)</td>', 'Brilliant! I love the deep contrasts - this is stunning! :)', '2007-05-22 13:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679615, 515653, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! I think the flower''s petals need a little more contrast, they''re kind of an overal bland gray... but otherwise this is beautiful!</td>', 'Cool! I think the flower''s petals need a little more contrast, they''re kind of an overal bland gray... but otherwise this is beautiful!', '2007-05-22 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679617, 516302, 63269, '<td valign="top">It might have been nice to brighten up the flowers and add a little more saturation; they are so small they are almost lost in the shot and the viewer may or may not notice that they are in color... but otherwise, good shot!</td>', 'It might have been nice to brighten up the flowers and add a little more saturation; they are so small they are almost lost in the shot and the viewer may or may not notice that they are in color... but otherwise, good shot!', '2007-05-22 13:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679618, 516516, 63269, '<td valign="top">VERY interesting idea!! I think it need some more contrast and might need to be just a tad brighter, but otherwise this is really cool. :)</td>', 'VERY interesting idea!! I think it need some more contrast and might need to be just a tad brighter, but otherwise this is really cool. :)', '2007-05-22 13:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679628, 516603, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is so cool! I love the contrasts - between the two guys hugging and the two guys walking away. It''s so bold and eye-catching. You have created a very provocative, striking image here. Good job, and awesome use of selective desaturation!</td>', 'Wow... this is so cool! I love the contrasts - between the two guys hugging and the two guys walking away. It''s so bold and eye-catching. You have created a very provocative, striking image here. Good job, and awesome use of selective desaturation!', '2007-05-22 13:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3679636, 516072, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very good - the composition and vibrant contrasts are great! <br/> <br/>One thing... just something silly that keeps catching my eye as I look at this shot, is that sign in the top left-hand corner. You know how when you put your mouse over the "challenges" button on DPC? and the little box scrolls down? That''s what I keep thinking it is. :) It''s pretty silly though, and the image is still awesome! ;)</td>', 'Very good - the composition and vibrant contrasts are great!  One thing... just something silly that keeps catching my eye as I look at this shot, is that sign in the top left-hand corner. You know how when you put your mouse over the "challenges" button on DPC? and the little box scrolls down? That''s what I keep thinking it is. :) It''s pretty silly though, and the image is still awesome! ;)', '2007-05-22 13:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
