(3679872, 516741, 78577, '<td valign="top">i like this picture alot... my only suggestion if you try this again is that this particular mask is so vibrant, so it seems that putting a sad face behind it takes away the effect... if she was laughing or smiling i think it would bring it all together a little better... im not a pro photographer or anything, i just know theatre haha beautiful pic tho</td>', 'i like this picture alot... my only suggestion if you try this again is that this particular mask is so vibrant, so it seems that putting a sad face behind it takes away the effect... if she was laughing or smiling i think it would bring it all together a little better... im not a pro photographer or anything, i just know theatre haha beautiful pic tho', '2007-05-22 14:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
