(3680065, 516290, 26255, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''m going to have to vote low on this one... potentially a good idea, but the obvious reflection of the photographer and house with driveway really ruin this image for me. To me it says either 1.) Lack of inspiration or worse 2.) Laziness. - 3</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''m going to have to vote low on this one... potentially a good idea, but the obvious reflection of the photographer and house with driveway really ruin this image for me. To me it says either 1.) Lack of inspiration or worse 2.) Laziness. - 3', '2007-05-22 14:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680067, 516675, 17148, '<td valign="top">Really like your idea here...but think the yellow should not stay the same intensity the entire way...off in the distance it should be less powerful than right close to the camera, to make it look real. It still looks good...really like your B&amp;W.</td>', 'Really like your idea here...but think the yellow should not stay the same intensity the entire way...off in the distance it should be less powerful than right close to the camera, to make it look real. It still looks good...really like your B&W.', '2007-05-22 14:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680068, 516585, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s the right eye that really freaks me out! Now I am thinking - what if real babies looked like that. Then it would be called cute, right? I am already looking forward to your next entry!</td>', 'It''s the right eye that really freaks me out! Now I am thinking - what if real babies looked like that. Then it would be called cute, right? I am already looking forward to your next entry!', '2007-05-22 14:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680070, 515049, 26255, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  My only dislike is the haloing around her hair.  It does have a nice photojournalistic feel to it though!</td>', 'I really like this one.  My only dislike is the haloing around her hair.  It does have a nice photojournalistic feel to it though!', '2007-05-22 14:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680073, 515200, 76184, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this photo because it is such a potent image. I''m not on board with your choice of color because it just seems so unrelated to the woman. I would rather this were all B&amp;W, but since this is a selective desat challenge, something has to be in color, right? I think her bags or even her in color might have been a better choice, but that might come off as cheesy.<br/> <br/>I originally voted this image a 5 with the intent to revisit it when I finished with the others. I''m not going to let the red sign be a speed bump in this image. It is just too good of a shot to have a "5," but for the challenge, the red sign does detract from the overall in my book. I''m bumping my vote to an 8.</td>', 'I had to come back to this photo because it is such a potent image. I''m not on board with your choice of color because it just seems so unrelated to the woman. I would rather this were all B&W, but since this is a selective desat challenge, something has to be in color, right? I think her bags or even her in color might have been a better choice, but that might come off as cheesy. I originally voted this image a 5 with the intent to revisit it when I finished with the others. I''m not going to let the red sign be a speed bump in this image. It is just too good of a shot to have a "5," but for the challenge, the red sign does detract from the overall in my book. I''m bumping my vote to an 8.', '2007-05-22 14:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680074, 517042, 26255, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little soft and I''m not a fan of the red border.  Nice concept though!</td>', 'The focus seems a little soft and I''m not a fan of the red border.  Nice concept though!', '2007-05-22 14:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680075, 513124, 40718, '<td valign="top">Gary?  This shot suffers in the B&amp;W conversion.  Seems to flat in the grays. 5</td>', 'Gary?  This shot suffers in the B&W conversion.  Seems to flat in the grays. 5', '2007-05-22 14:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680077, 514379, 5792, '<td valign="top">I scored this image a 6 which to me means unsatisfactory but not a failure.<br/> <br/>The problem is the nose is out-of-focus, and that is what you chose to leave colored so you draw even more attention to that defect. The expression you captured was perfect and fits the desat theme of the picture well and is otherwise a very nice composition. It does have weak greyscale tonality but that is not as glaring as the nose.<br/> <br/>You may have just chosen the wrong central focal point. With the depth of field you already had you could have focused on the nose and still had the eyes and mouth in sharp focus. Another thing you could have done was to shoot at a higher f/number for greater depth of field. If you chose to have the nose out-of-focus purposely then that was the wrong decision. It will just look like a mistake to most viewers.<br/> <br/>For improved greyscale tonality you could reduced contrast to bring back detail then increase just the black with "Selective Color" and still retained the BW impact of the image.</td>', 'I scored this image a 6 which to me means unsatisfactory but not a failure. The problem is the nose is out-of-focus, and that is what you chose to leave colored so you draw even more attention to that defect. The expression you captured was perfect and fits the desat theme of the picture well and is otherwise a very nice composition. It does have weak greyscale tonality but that is not as glaring as the nose. You may have just chosen the wrong central focal point. With the depth of field you already had you could have focused on the nose and still had the eyes and mouth in sharp focus. Another thing you could have done was to shoot at a higher f/number for greater depth of field. If you chose to have the nose out-of-focus purposely then that was the wrong decision. It will just look like a mistake to most viewers. For improved greyscale tonality you could reduced contrast to bring back detail then increase just the black with "Selective Color" and still retained the BW impact of the image.', '2007-05-22 14:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680081, 517057, 26255, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to comment on every image I vote on and I''m trying to be constructive, but honestly I don''t have anything for this one... It lacks any sense of drama or creativity IMHO.</td>', 'I''m trying to comment on every image I vote on and I''m trying to be constructive, but honestly I don''t have anything for this one... It lacks any sense of drama or creativity IMHO.', '2007-05-22 14:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
