(3680087, 515906, 26255, '<td valign="top">Potentially a good idea, but this has a "high-key" feel with muted tones... In other words, the face is too grey.  Or it''s blown out and then darkened... either way it doesn''t work for me. - 4</td>', 'Potentially a good idea, but this has a "high-key" feel with muted tones... In other words, the face is too grey.  Or it''s blown out and then darkened... either way it doesn''t work for me. - 4', '2007-05-22 14:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3680099, 516915, 5792, '<td valign="top">Compositionally a nice image and the desaturated color of the Starbucks cup works well for a theme dep[icting that we are not quite awake yet when we get that first cup of coffee. The color in the cigarette looks off and out of place in this image and will probably hurt it in voting. Might have looked better if totally BW with visible smoke curling up from it or possibly with the whole cigarette in color.</td>', 'Compositionally a nice image and the desaturated color of the Starbucks cup works well for a theme dep[icting that we are not quite awake yet when we get that first cup of coffee. The color in the cigarette looks off and out of place in this image and will probably hurt it in voting. Might have looked better if totally BW with visible smoke curling up from it or possibly with the whole cigarette in color.', '2007-05-22 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
