(3681041, 516568, 9906, '<td valign="top">I really like the overall look of this one.  I do wish I could see it at 8x10 instead of 640xWhatever...  You do have what appears to be some oversharpening artifacts around the girls arms.  I think for this media (DPC) I woulda cropped differently to make her a little more prominent.  I think that a more saturated red would also make this pop a bit more at this size!<br/>TC</td>', 'I really like the overall look of this one.  I do wish I could see it at 8x10 instead of 640xWhatever...  You do have what appears to be some oversharpening artifacts around the girls arms.  I think for this media (DPC) I woulda cropped differently to make her a little more prominent.  I think that a more saturated red would also make this pop a bit more at this size!TC', '2007-05-22 18:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
