(3681230, 515285, 51793, '<td valign="top">Very soft. She looks uncomfortable. I think this would have been excuted a better by her actually standing on the ground while they hug. She really looks like she is hanging on for dear life.</td>', 'Very soft. She looks uncomfortable. I think this would have been excuted a better by her actually standing on the ground while they hug. She really looks like she is hanging on for dear life.', '2007-05-22 19:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3681239, 517046, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; the color is a bit bright for the remainder of the scene, and a longer lens would have brought the opponent a little closer.</td>', 'Nice shot; the color is a bit bright for the remainder of the scene, and a longer lens would have brought the opponent a little closer.', '2007-05-22 19:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3681240, 515724, 76198, '<td valign="top">The desat here (in my opinion) fails to enhance the photo, and so serves more as a distraction in what would be otherwise a very nice picture.</td>', 'The desat here (in my opinion) fails to enhance the photo, and so serves more as a distraction in what would be otherwise a very nice picture.', '2007-05-22 19:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3681245, 515801, 76198, '<td valign="top">Bit of oversharpening problems around his head, and the "Watermelon/straw" thing is a bit of a reach for me... but I appreciate the homage to last time''s winner!</td>', 'Bit of oversharpening problems around his head, and the "Watermelon/straw" thing is a bit of a reach for me... but I appreciate the homage to last time''s winner!', '2007-05-22 19:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3681247, 516700, 51793, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the concept here. Initially I gave this a 10 but going back thru I decided to look closer at the image. <br/> <br/>I think your missing some sharpness and clarity. I also think that your border is too big. You''re shirt is kinda to dark also. IMO. So I gave you an 8 instead. <br/> <br/>Still one of the more creative ones though.</td>', 'I like the idea and the concept here. Initially I gave this a 10 but going back thru I decided to look closer at the image.  I think your missing some sharpness and clarity. I also think that your border is too big. You''re shirt is kinda to dark also. IMO. So I gave you an 8 instead.  Still one of the more creative ones though.', '2007-05-22 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3681248, 515361, 76198, '<td valign="top">Good idea; the wood in the background is not very interesting, unfortunately.</td>', 'Good idea; the wood in the background is not very interesting, unfortunately.', '2007-05-22 19:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3681249, 516568, 76198, '<td valign="top">This would be great, really among the best, if she didn''t have that unfortunate dodging halo around her. Beautiful shot, though, so I''ll still give it a 7.</td>', 'This would be great, really among the best, if she didn''t have that unfortunate dodging halo around her. Beautiful shot, though, so I''ll still give it a 7.', '2007-05-22 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
