(3681258, 516366, 74533, '<td valign="top">I find all the wires accross the photo very distracting.  Was it possible to shoot from a different angle or could you have done a tighter crop and cloned out a powerline or two.</td>', 'I find all the wires accross the photo very distracting.  Was it possible to shoot from a different angle or could you have done a tighter crop and cloned out a powerline or two.', '2007-05-22 19:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
