(3681948, 516330, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice cat picture!  The composition is great with the eye "pointing" to the corner, sharpness and detail are nice, and you got the all-important catchlights in the eyes.  Only thing I would do is clone out the little bit of goopy wet under the eye.  The reflection there distracts from the lovely eye.  And, um, makes me want to clean the cat''s eyes ;-)</td>', 'Nice cat picture!  The composition is great with the eye "pointing" to the corner, sharpness and detail are nice, and you got the all-important catchlights in the eyes.  Only thing I would do is clone out the little bit of goopy wet under the eye.  The reflection there distracts from the lovely eye.  And, um, makes me want to clean the cat''s eyes ;-)', '2007-05-22 21:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
