(3682070, 515238, 15711, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!!  What a wonderful face.  I''m assuming Special Olympics winner?  What a terrific tribute. I love it.</td>', 'Congratulations!!!  What a wonderful face.  I''m assuming Special Olympics winner?  What a terrific tribute. I love it.', '2007-05-22 22:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682071, 513385, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this very much, where the prey draws not only the cat''s eyes but the viewers as well.  Just wish the fish, especially, was in sharp focus and not so noisy.</td>', 'I like the idea of this very much, where the prey draws not only the cat''s eyes but the viewers as well.  Just wish the fish, especially, was in sharp focus and not so noisy.', '2007-05-22 22:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682075, 513748, 15711, '<td valign="top">Must be a boy. ;~D</td>', 'Must be a boy. ;~D', '2007-05-22 22:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682081, 516627, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I love the bokeh.</td>', 'Interesting.  I love the bokeh.', '2007-05-22 22:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682089, 516691, 65234, '<td valign="top">Columbine is lovely, but would have been the focal point even without the desat (which appears to still have a purple tint to it).</td>', 'Columbine is lovely, but would have been the focal point even without the desat (which appears to still have a purple tint to it).', '2007-05-22 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682091, 516711, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect....10. I really like how the color frames the subject. Beautiful, just beautiful.</td>', 'Perfect....10. I really like how the color frames the subject. Beautiful, just beautiful.', '2007-05-22 22:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682104, 514225, 33672, '<td valign="top">Too funny! Great comp. grain works well.</td>', 'Too funny! Great comp. grain works well.', '2007-05-22 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682106, 517081, 48560, '<td valign="top">lovely desat, coupled with good DOF control</td>', 'lovely desat, coupled with good DOF control', '2007-05-22 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682111, 513622, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think that is REALLY good.  That touch of pink is really an attribute, not just somebody leaving in some colour.  It''s thought out and I love the hair falling over her face.  Great high tones and the hint of softness. I''m a sucker for a 3/4 profile anyway. One of the best of this challenge.</td>', 'I think that is REALLY good.  That touch of pink is really an attribute, not just somebody leaving in some colour.  It''s thought out and I love the hair falling over her face.  Great high tones and the hint of softness. I''m a sucker for a 3/4 profile anyway. One of the best of this challenge.', '2007-05-22 22:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682114, 516915, 65234, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of desat to emphasize your point.</td>', 'Excellent use of desat to emphasize your point.', '2007-05-22 22:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682122, 515811, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is really creative!</td>', 'This is really creative!', '2007-05-22 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682125, 516070, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the glasses and we can still see the brightness of her eyes through them.  I''d have only had the glasses in pink and not included the hood.  I''m yearning for a bit more contrast. I like the bokeh and use of neg. space.</td>', 'I love the glasses and we can still see the brightness of her eyes through them.  I''d have only had the glasses in pink and not included the hood.  I''m yearning for a bit more contrast. I like the bokeh and use of neg. space.', '2007-05-22 22:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682135, 516599, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool.  Her eye colour is awesome. I wish somehow her hand weren''t so blurred.  With it being in the light, it is a bit distracting not being in focus.</td>', 'That''s pretty cool.  Her eye colour is awesome. I wish somehow her hand weren''t so blurred.  With it being in the light, it is a bit distracting not being in focus.', '2007-05-22 22:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682139, 516828, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great exposure.  The roses'' blooms and stems aren''t so bright that they look fake against the black and white finish of the rest of the shot. I love her hair and eyelashes. Very pretty.</td>', 'Great exposure.  The roses'' blooms and stems aren''t so bright that they look fake against the black and white finish of the rest of the shot. I love her hair and eyelashes. Very pretty.', '2007-05-22 22:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682143, 515616, 48560, '<td valign="top">ooh, lovely dramatic lighting!<br/>great work</td>', 'ooh, lovely dramatic lighting!great work', '2007-05-22 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682224, 513367, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a delight amidst so much below par entries.  The exposure, composition and lighting are spot on.  Plus you made it funny.  Great job.</td>', 'What a delight amidst so much below par entries.  The exposure, composition and lighting are spot on.  Plus you made it funny.  Great job.', '2007-05-22 22:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682273, 516424, 31439, '<td valign="top">Great clarity.  I like that you chose to focus in on her near eye.  Well done.</td>', 'Great clarity.  I like that you chose to focus in on her near eye.  Well done.', '2007-05-22 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682299, 514176, 59925, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like the subtle transitions in color.</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like the subtle transitions in color.', '2007-05-22 22:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682308, 515904, 31439, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better if the biker in the front was the focus of the photo, or maybe if the orange cones weren''t in color.  I don''t know...there just seems to be a lot going on here.  My eyes are going all over the place.</td>', 'I think I would like this better if the biker in the front was the focus of the photo, or maybe if the orange cones weren''t in color.  I don''t know...there just seems to be a lot going on here.  My eyes are going all over the place.', '2007-05-22 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682316, 516689, 31439, '<td valign="top">A very touching photo.  Well done! 8</td>', 'A very touching photo.  Well done! 8', '2007-05-22 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3682334, 514860, 31439, '<td valign="top">A touching photo, but I''m not sure if the focus is the colors on the shirt or the cast, as both seem to be in color.  It''s a nice photo though.</td>', 'A touching photo, but I''m not sure if the focus is the colors on the shirt or the cast, as both seem to be in color.  It''s a nice photo though.', '2007-05-22 22:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
