(3686112, 512146, 25024, '<td valign="top">The bird has very vibrant colours especially against a mono background, but, if I may be constructively critical it lacks sharp focus, it is too near the centre for any impact and the featureless sky adds nothing. Perhaps a crop of that long branch to the top left pushing the bird higher, nearer to the thirds intersection would have improved it compositionally. Good luck</td>', 'The bird has very vibrant colours especially against a mono background, but, if I may be constructively critical it lacks sharp focus, it is too near the centre for any impact and the featureless sky adds nothing. Perhaps a crop of that long branch to the top left pushing the bird higher, nearer to the thirds intersection would have improved it compositionally. Good luck', '2007-05-23 13:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3686138, 516059, 25024, '<td valign="top">This is a good macro but on my screen I''m sorry, but it looks a little over-sharpened. I wonder if cropping a chunk off the left may have given it a bit better composition? I actually like the OOF of the wing tips. Good luck</td>', 'This is a good macro but on my screen I''m sorry, but it looks a little over-sharpened. I wonder if cropping a chunk off the left may have given it a bit better composition? I actually like the OOF of the wing tips. Good luck', '2007-05-23 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3686150, 513957, 72317, '<td valign="top">The saturated part looks oversaturated to me, atleast in the green background. It''s sort of distracting. The eyes look a tad off.. Either like there was too much done to them.. Or maybe they just turned out that way. Not sure.</td>', 'The saturated part looks oversaturated to me, atleast in the green background. It''s sort of distracting. The eyes look a tad off.. Either like there was too much done to them.. Or maybe they just turned out that way. Not sure.', '2007-05-23 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3686153, 515898, 63269, '<td valign="top">The child almost sems a little out of focus, but I''m not sure... Also, one thing I might have suggested for this shot is a less cluttered background. For example, you might have waited for the people and the other child to walk out of the way, and then cropped out the top of the shot. Then you would have had a great composition and everything! Very good try though, and neat idea! :)</td>', 'The child almost sems a little out of focus, but I''m not sure... Also, one thing I might have suggested for this shot is a less cluttered background. For example, you might have waited for the people and the other child to walk out of the way, and then cropped out the top of the shot. Then you would have had a great composition and everything! Very good try though, and neat idea! :)', '2007-05-23 13:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
