(3689398, 514379, 38477, '<td valign="top">Even lighting on both sides of the face would have made this a good exposure. 7</td>', 'Even lighting on both sides of the face would have made this a good exposure. 7', '2007-05-24 01:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689402, 514120, 38477, '<td valign="top">Blue eyes are very very small, may be the bride holding a bunch of floweres (colored) would have helped. IMHO</td>', 'Blue eyes are very very small, may be the bride holding a bunch of floweres (colored) would have helped. IMHO', '2007-05-24 01:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689404, 516271, 78255, '<td valign="top">Amazing image. Excellent!</td>', 'Amazing image. Excellent!', '2007-05-24 01:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689405, 516214, 43410, '<td valign="top">gorgeous</td>', 'gorgeous', '2007-05-24 01:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689414, 515724, 72852, '<td valign="top">Very cool mesh of b&amp;w and color.  Nice selection to desaturate...it adds some mystery to the image.</td>', 'Very cool mesh of b&w and color.  Nice selection to desaturate...it adds some mystery to the image.', '2007-05-24 01:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689423, 516788, 43410, '<td valign="top">she is absolutely breathtaking, very beautiful girl.  very well done</td>', 'she is absolutely breathtaking, very beautiful girl.  very well done', '2007-05-24 01:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689430, 517021, 43410, '<td valign="top">nice image, but way too much neat image/noise removal.  all detail seems to be lost in this.  with this being advanced, you can run the noise ninja on a duplicate layer, and then create a mask and with a black brush go in and paint over the areas where you want detail to remain, eyes, hair, for example.  i''d turn the strength down on whatever noise reduction software you used on this.  not downing the photo at all.  just an opinion.  she''s a very beautiful girl and i like the detail work you did on the eyes.</td>', 'nice image, but way too much neat image/noise removal.  all detail seems to be lost in this.  with this being advanced, you can run the noise ninja on a duplicate layer, and then create a mask and with a black brush go in and paint over the areas where you want detail to remain, eyes, hair, for example.  i''d turn the strength down on whatever noise reduction software you used on this.  not downing the photo at all.  just an opinion.  she''s a very beautiful girl and i like the detail work you did on the eyes.', '2007-05-24 01:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689432, 516434, 43410, '<td valign="top">breathtaking image.  love it</td>', 'breathtaking image.  love it', '2007-05-24 01:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689434, 515049, 43410, '<td valign="top">this is great, nice use of selective desat to isolate the model even more.  very effective.  good luck with this one</td>', 'this is great, nice use of selective desat to isolate the model even more.  very effective.  good luck with this one', '2007-05-24 01:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689440, 514788, 43410, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2007-05-24 01:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689456, 516355, 18197, '<td valign="top">Way too much noise reduction for my taste.</td>', 'Way too much noise reduction for my taste.', '2007-05-24 02:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689469, 516299, 1, '<td valign="top">The composition of this is great.  At first glance, I didn''t like it, I think, because it looks messy (dirty bug, and the maybe the seams of the flower and off-white color of it).  On second glance, I noticed the composure, and the wonderful DOF w/ the bending flower in the background.  I wonder if the impact would''ve been greater without the bug.</td>', 'The composition of this is great.  At first glance, I didn''t like it, I think, because it looks messy (dirty bug, and the maybe the seams of the flower and off-white color of it).  On second glance, I noticed the composure, and the wonderful DOF w/ the bending flower in the background.  I wonder if the impact would''ve been greater without the bug.', '2007-05-24 02:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689473, 513685, 67841, '<td valign="top">I find myself really drawn to this one - this little guy was quite the find for you!</td>', 'I find myself really drawn to this one - this little guy was quite the find for you!', '2007-05-24 02:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689483, 516290, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  To be honest, I was turned off by the fact that you are in the reflection but the overall effect won me over in the end.  Nice job on a great concept...</td>', 'Very cool!  To be honest, I was turned off by the fact that you are in the reflection but the overall effect won me over in the end.  Nice job on a great concept...', '2007-05-24 02:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689600, 516426, 30982, '<td valign="top">Having chased ducks and geese around a pond for several months now, watching them grow, I''m in awe of your ability to get these guys to look so crisp!  Very nice use of desat - not overpowering and really showcases your subject well.</td>', 'Having chased ducks and geese around a pond for several months now, watching them grow, I''m in awe of your ability to get these guys to look so crisp!  Very nice use of desat - not overpowering and really showcases your subject well.', '2007-05-24 03:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689601, 516991, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the motion and the energy here.</td>', 'Love the motion and the energy here.', '2007-05-24 03:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689602, 516278, 30982, '<td valign="top">Subdued and very effective use of selected color.</td>', 'Subdued and very effective use of selected color.', '2007-05-24 03:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689608, 516973, 30982, '<td valign="top">exceptional artwork and a great photograph</td>', 'exceptional artwork and a great photograph', '2007-05-24 04:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689609, 514475, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very nice use of this technique!</td>', 'A very nice use of this technique!', '2007-05-24 04:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689610, 515238, 30982, '<td valign="top">The golden part of this is his look of triumph and achievement.  A wonderful portrait!</td>', 'The golden part of this is his look of triumph and achievement.  A wonderful portrait!', '2007-05-24 04:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689611, 516341, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good shot for this technique.</td>', 'Very good shot for this technique.', '2007-05-24 04:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689613, 513622, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of high key and subtle desat.</td>', 'Nice use of high key and subtle desat.', '2007-05-24 04:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689614, 512884, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colorful guys!  Nice way to accentuate that feature.</td>', 'Colorful guys!  Nice way to accentuate that feature.', '2007-05-24 04:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689615, 516610, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent composition.</td>', 'An excellent composition.', '2007-05-24 04:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689616, 515828, 30982, '<td valign="top">Works very well, very nicely composed.  I''m betting there isn''t a great deal more color in the fully saturated version, which is nice.</td>', 'Works very well, very nicely composed.  I''m betting there isn''t a great deal more color in the fully saturated version, which is nice.', '2007-05-24 04:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689618, 516885, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like it alot.  I love the composition of this and the desat works well - red, black, and white are a good combo.</td>', 'I like it alot.  I love the composition of this and the desat works well - red, black, and white are a good combo.', '2007-05-24 04:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689619, 512643, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Interesting use of desat to keep the one thing people try to get rid of - the dreaded red-eye!  Poor sheep...</td>', 'Heh!  Interesting use of desat to keep the one thing people try to get rid of - the dreaded red-eye!  Poor sheep...', '2007-05-24 04:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689622, 516379, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the combination of yellow and black, but it seems a bit over-somethinged in processing which takes away any sense of depth to the picture.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the combination of yellow and black, but it seems a bit over-somethinged in processing which takes away any sense of depth to the picture.', '2007-05-24 04:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689623, 514818, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the differing textures but don''t get a lot more than that out of the composition.</td>', 'I like the differing textures but don''t get a lot more than that out of the composition.', '2007-05-24 04:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689627, 515617, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach and this must have taken a lot of work!  I think it might have had more "punch" to it if you''d converted the base picture such that the red rose had more of a white appearance than a dark gray - this would make the rose stand out more from the background, maybe.</td>', 'An interesting approach and this must have taken a lot of work!  I think it might have had more "punch" to it if you''d converted the base picture such that the red rose had more of a white appearance than a dark gray - this would make the rose stand out more from the background, maybe.', '2007-05-24 04:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689633, 514291, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s not enough to differentiate between the boat and the building so it sort of appears a bit jumbled.</td>', 'There''s not enough to differentiate between the boat and the building so it sort of appears a bit jumbled.', '2007-05-24 04:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689636, 515762, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks so relaxed!  Good job with the desat; composition is a bit centered but it''s a good overall shot.</td>', 'He looks so relaxed!  Good job with the desat; composition is a bit centered but it''s a good overall shot.', '2007-05-24 04:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689640, 516908, 30982, '<td valign="top">Who knew cars weren''t colorblind?  Neat idea.</td>', 'Who knew cars weren''t colorblind?  Neat idea.', '2007-05-24 04:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689641, 516757, 30982, '<td valign="top">I know this is a "selective desat" challenge but I can''t help but think this rocks in pure B&amp;W.</td>', 'I know this is a "selective desat" challenge but I can''t help but think this rocks in pure B&W.', '2007-05-24 04:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689642, 516375, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has an evilness to it that I think is directly the result of the desat technique.</td>', 'This has an evilness to it that I think is directly the result of the desat technique.', '2007-05-24 04:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689644, 513633, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good use of desat - nice composition and I like the high key.</td>', 'Good use of desat - nice composition and I like the high key.', '2007-05-24 04:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689646, 516653, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed but the color to me is too colorful.  Maybe partially desat the selective desat?</td>', 'Nicely composed but the color to me is too colorful.  Maybe partially desat the selective desat?', '2007-05-24 04:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689647, 517023, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the pop of the color - just enough.  Like the grain alot.</td>', 'I like the pop of the color - just enough.  Like the grain alot.', '2007-05-24 04:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689653, 517088, 30982, '<td valign="top">What I like about this is how the desat brought out just how gaudy the chandelier thingie is.</td>', 'What I like about this is how the desat brought out just how gaudy the chandelier thingie is.', '2007-05-24 04:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689657, 517071, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dreamlike quality is very nice - almost as though the horse doesn''t really exist and you can only see it if you close your eyes.</td>', 'Dreamlike quality is very nice - almost as though the horse doesn''t really exist and you can only see it if you close your eyes.', '2007-05-24 04:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689660, 513915, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a surreal aspect to it, like it was shot on the moon.  I hate that they''ve painted over all of them, in a way.  I seem to recall seeing shots when they still looked like cars instead of multicolored alien invaders.</td>', 'Has a surreal aspect to it, like it was shot on the moon.  I hate that they''ve painted over all of them, in a way.  I seem to recall seeing shots when they still looked like cars instead of multicolored alien invaders.', '2007-05-24 04:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689673, 512205, 56672, '<td valign="top">I have to question - was this actually desaturated, or was the sky just that color?  It''s nice either way.</td>', 'I have to question - was this actually desaturated, or was the sky just that color?  It''s nice either way.', '2007-05-24 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689696, 513685, 30982, '<td valign="top">Detail is exceptional and the desat is subtle and effective.  Well composed, high-impact kinda shot without being overdone.</td>', 'Detail is exceptional and the desat is subtle and effective.  Well composed, high-impact kinda shot without being overdone.', '2007-05-24 05:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689700, 516374, 30982, '<td valign="top">The desat aspect is OK, but the picture is exceptional - very nice portrait - love the use of the umbrella as a background.</td>', 'The desat aspect is OK, but the picture is exceptional - very nice portrait - love the use of the umbrella as a background.', '2007-05-24 05:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689701, 513797, 30982, '<td valign="top">Could be used as an ad campaign photo.</td>', 'Could be used as an ad campaign photo.', '2007-05-24 05:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689704, 516634, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like her somewhat uninterested bordering on disgusted look.  My kind of shot - very busy and interesting.  Since it is a desat challenge, I do like the way you framed her with the red.</td>', 'I really like her somewhat uninterested bordering on disgusted look.  My kind of shot - very busy and interesting.  Since it is a desat challenge, I do like the way you framed her with the red.', '2007-05-24 05:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689705, 515418, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well seen and captured.  Love the raindrops.</td>', 'Well seen and captured.  Love the raindrops.', '2007-05-24 05:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689709, 515564, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of the technique, lovely lighting, excellent composition.</td>', 'Very effective use of the technique, lovely lighting, excellent composition.', '2007-05-24 05:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689711, 516970, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good portrait - the desat seems to be used to bring out an important aspect of the person, and the portrait itself shows a warmth and friendliness.  Well done.</td>', 'A very good portrait - the desat seems to be used to bring out an important aspect of the person, and the portrait itself shows a warmth and friendliness.  Well done.', '2007-05-24 05:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689714, 515346, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely work with the detail on the flower.  I think my only nit might be that the paint on the brush appears too "thick" to be used to paint the flower.  Very nicely conceived and executed.</td>', 'Lovely work with the detail on the flower.  I think my only nit might be that the paint on the brush appears too "thick" to be used to paint the flower.  Very nicely conceived and executed.', '2007-05-24 05:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689716, 516541, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you chose.  I think my issue with this is he looks like he''s about to lose his lunch.  Combine that with the tomato sauce and it''s a bit unappetizing.</td>', 'I like the angle you chose.  I think my issue with this is he looks like he''s about to lose his lunch.  Combine that with the tomato sauce and it''s a bit unappetizing.', '2007-05-24 05:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689719, 516585, 30982, '<td valign="top">Creepy, which I''m hoping was your intent.</td>', 'Creepy, which I''m hoping was your intent.', '2007-05-24 05:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689720, 515293, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a good job with the desaturation but there''s just not a lot to hold a viewer''s interest in the shot itself.</td>', 'You''ve done a good job with the desaturation but there''s just not a lot to hold a viewer''s interest in the shot itself.', '2007-05-24 05:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689726, 514434, 30982, '<td valign="top">Normally to me desat works best if subtle - here it works well due to the very strong supporting composition.</td>', 'Normally to me desat works best if subtle - here it works well due to the very strong supporting composition.', '2007-05-24 06:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689728, 516865, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, the boy seems almost incidental to the photograph as opposed to something which you want to highlight.</td>', 'To me, the boy seems almost incidental to the photograph as opposed to something which you want to highlight.', '2007-05-24 06:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689730, 517003, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell that anything has been desaturated here.</td>', 'I can''t really tell that anything has been desaturated here.', '2007-05-24 06:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689735, 516048, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of an unhappy youngster.  The eyes seem an unnatural shade of blue to me, though.</td>', 'Very nice capture of an unhappy youngster.  The eyes seem an unnatural shade of blue to me, though.', '2007-05-24 06:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3689765, 516973, 75274, '<td valign="top">very creative!</td>', 'very creative!', '2007-05-24 06:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
