(3690211, 515953, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and a little strange at the same time.  First, it''s a very nice composition.  I wish the rose ''bud'' center area had a little more DOF and focus.  As for the strange part...it seems weird to see beads of water in color on a B/W image.  JMO of course.  Maybe if it was a red rose initially instead of an orange/yellow one?  Nice effort on isolating the selected drops in a seamless manner.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, no vote.  :)</td>', 'This is interesting and a little strange at the same time.  First, it''s a very nice composition.  I wish the rose ''bud'' center area had a little more DOF and focus.  As for the strange part...it seems weird to see beads of water in color on a B/W image.  JMO of course.  Maybe if it was a red rose initially instead of an orange/yellow one?  Nice effort on isolating the selected drops in a seamless manner.  Best of luck to you in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, no vote.  :)', '2007-05-24 10:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
