(3690236, 516153, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive shot.  Certainly leaves the viewer wondering what the story is.  I associate the title and setting with an engagement type announcement yet it appears to be a man that is surprised.  Did she propose to him?  Did he win something?  Did he just find out he''s going to be a new dad?  Hmmm...hopefully the story will surface after the challenge?<br/> <br/>You did a nice job of isolating the glass and liquid for the desat.  I think it would be a tad stronger if you had left the non-liquid part of the glass in grayscale (stem and uppper glass above the liquid).</td>', 'Nice emotive shot.  Certainly leaves the viewer wondering what the story is.  I associate the title and setting with an engagement type announcement yet it appears to be a man that is surprised.  Did she propose to him?  Did he win something?  Did he just find out he''s going to be a new dad?  Hmmm...hopefully the story will surface after the challenge? You did a nice job of isolating the glass and liquid for the desat.  I think it would be a tad stronger if you had left the non-liquid part of the glass in grayscale (stem and uppper glass above the liquid).', '2007-05-24 10:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
