(3690307, 516397, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s quite an effective shot. I like the low angle you have chosen, it feels like like a private sanctuary you are envious to share. Good luck</td>', 'That''s quite an effective shot. I like the low angle you have chosen, it feels like like a private sanctuary you are envious to share. Good luck', '2007-05-24 10:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
