(3690440, 516626, 25024, '<td valign="top">Not a very good one is she, think she needs a bit more practice! Good idea, I like this sort of approach to the challenge, good luck.</td>', 'Not a very good one is she, think she needs a bit more practice! Good idea, I like this sort of approach to the challenge, good luck.', '2007-05-24 11:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690450, 516516, 25024, '<td valign="top">A novel and different approach to the challenge, full marks for originality, I just wonder if it may have been more powerful the other way round, you know usual exterior and you find a mono and extremely vexing mono core. That way you would have a greater contrast with your background. Just my thoughts for what they''re worth, good luck</td>', 'A novel and different approach to the challenge, full marks for originality, I just wonder if it may have been more powerful the other way round, you know usual exterior and you find a mono and extremely vexing mono core. That way you would have a greater contrast with your background. Just my thoughts for what they''re worth, good luck', '2007-05-24 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
