(3690549, 516583, 74534, '<td valign="top">With some more post-processing, this could have been a hit: a channel mixer conversion to B&amp;W for more contrast and punch in the background, a bit of saturation and a contrast bump on the geese, etc. An angle with the birds facing somewhat towards the camera would have helped as well, though I don''t know if this was possible at the time :). Maybe also a lower point of view, from their eye level, and crop out the last bird, that cut in half anyway?</td>', 'With some more post-processing, this could have been a hit: a channel mixer conversion to B&W for more contrast and punch in the background, a bit of saturation and a contrast bump on the geese, etc. An angle with the birds facing somewhat towards the camera would have helped as well, though I don''t know if this was possible at the time :). Maybe also a lower point of view, from their eye level, and crop out the last bird, that cut in half anyway?', '2007-05-24 11:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690553, 516375, 74534, '<td valign="top">How about leaving the kid in color as well?</td>', 'How about leaving the kid in color as well?', '2007-05-24 11:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
