(3690643, 517051, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very, very awesome. This is a complete classic!  My first reaction was, "wow, this is so neat!" Second reactions was that it might be interesting to see it if it had been cropped a tiny bit less on the right side of the shot. But I''m just being picky. This is wonderful! :)</td>', 'Very, very awesome. This is a complete classic!  My first reaction was, "wow, this is so neat!" Second reactions was that it might be interesting to see it if it had been cropped a tiny bit less on the right side of the shot. But I''m just being picky. This is wonderful! :)', '2007-05-24 12:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
