(3690646, 516661, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Have to work really hard to figure out what''s been left to color.  The theme and title is cute.  Did you look at this cropped in substantially tighter to bring more focus to your subject (the eye)?  I think the story of ''Freedom'' could still be told that way.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  Have to work really hard to figure out what''s been left to color.  The theme and title is cute.  Did you look at this cropped in substantially tighter to bring more focus to your subject (the eye)?  I think the story of ''Freedom'' could still be told that way.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-24 12:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690662, 516991, 56658, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.nice job panning.</td>', 'very cool shot.nice job panning.', '2007-05-24 12:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690664, 516112, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a nice feel to it.  Works well for the desat theme.  The photo is well composed and is interesting to look at.  If I had one complaint it would be that once you get past the front wall the focus isn''t strong enough.  A deeper aperture perhaps?  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.  :)</td>', 'This has a nice feel to it.  Works well for the desat theme.  The photo is well composed and is interesting to look at.  If I had one complaint it would be that once you get past the front wall the focus isn''t strong enough.  A deeper aperture perhaps?  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.  :)', '2007-05-24 12:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690665, 516397, 58610, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you intended the fence to be out of focus, but I would like it better in focus. The reason being - even though the subject is highlighted in color, the fence acts as an important detail in the telling of the story. She is isolated in her own world and the fence is what she is hiding behind. Because of that emotional connection, I feel it would work better. Like the shot a lot.</td>', 'Perhaps you intended the fence to be out of focus, but I would like it better in focus. The reason being - even though the subject is highlighted in color, the fence acts as an important detail in the telling of the story. She is isolated in her own world and the fence is what she is hiding behind. Because of that emotional connection, I feel it would work better. Like the shot a lot.', '2007-05-24 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690666, 516568, 56658, '<td valign="top">nice shot. you are kicking my butt BTW. (no vote)</td>', 'nice shot. you are kicking my butt BTW. (no vote)', '2007-05-24 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690668, 515924, 30049, '<td valign="top">When I look at this I feel I want more.  Like that tiny little speck of color is a big tease.  :)  Technically this is within the spirit of the challenge and everything, but the subject selected doesn''t lend itself well for selective desat IMO.  It''s also possible that I could be missing the point of the exercise.  :P  Good luck to you in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.  :)</td>', 'When I look at this I feel I want more.  Like that tiny little speck of color is a big tease.  :)  Technically this is within the spirit of the challenge and everything, but the subject selected doesn''t lend itself well for selective desat IMO.  It''s also possible that I could be missing the point of the exercise.  :P  Good luck to you in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.  :)', '2007-05-24 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690673, 516375, 66348, '<td valign="top">Really like the shot, and editing done. Looks like a lot of work. Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Really like the shot, and editing done. Looks like a lot of work. Nice composition and colors.', '2007-05-24 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
