(3690807, 516111, 58610, '<td valign="top">It would be even more effective with the green desaturated as well.</td>', 'It would be even more effective with the green desaturated as well.', '2007-05-24 12:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690809, 511697, 58610, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract nature of this.</td>', 'Love the abstract nature of this.', '2007-05-24 12:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690835, 514379, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a lovely model, great expression, fantastic eyes and catchlights, and those freckles, well... Looking at the reflection on the nose I think perhaps you lost an opportunity to give it even more impact with sharp focus on the nose as well? Good luck</td>', 'What a lovely model, great expression, fantastic eyes and catchlights, and those freckles, well... Looking at the reflection on the nose I think perhaps you lost an opportunity to give it even more impact with sharp focus on the nose as well? Good luck', '2007-05-24 12:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690887, 515402, 60275, '<td valign="top">Great capture but I think the extreme PP takes something away from it.</td>', 'Great capture but I think the extreme PP takes something away from it.', '2007-05-24 13:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690891, 516153, 25024, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the moment well, what a lovely happy face the girl has and nicely cropped too. I would have liked to see his expression and perhaps a little sharper too but with similar DOF of the girl. Good range  of tones but I think red wine in a plain glass may have worked even better. Good luck</td>', 'You''ve captured the moment well, what a lovely happy face the girl has and nicely cropped too. I would have liked to see his expression and perhaps a little sharper too but with similar DOF of the girl. Good range  of tones but I think red wine in a plain glass may have worked even better. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690921, 515758, 60275, '<td valign="top">I would''ve like it more if a bit wider (just enough to get the whole drawing in). Still, I very much like it.</td>', 'I would''ve like it more if a bit wider (just enough to get the whole drawing in). Still, I very much like it.', '2007-05-24 13:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690927, 516973, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hey thats clever, someone''s a good face artist! It certainly deserves a high score for originality and effort. Good luck</td>', 'Hey thats clever, someone''s a good face artist! It certainly deserves a high score for originality and effort. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690936, 516332, 25024, '<td valign="top">Quite a good capture, I like the way you have desat just the background and left the twig as is, it works much better this way. Good DOF but would have liked to have seen the bird a little sharper. Good luck</td>', 'Quite a good capture, I like the way you have desat just the background and left the twig as is, it works much better this way. Good DOF but would have liked to have seen the bird a little sharper. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690937, 514432, 60275, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea/image. I don''t see the title working for it though.</td>', 'Lovely idea/image. I don''t see the title working for it though.', '2007-05-24 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690958, 517042, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice image with an admirable theme, the caps make it, but it looks a little too soft, good luck</td>', 'That''s a nice image with an admirable theme, the caps make it, but it looks a little too soft, good luck', '2007-05-24 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690969, 514205, 25024, '<td valign="top">Shame it wasn''t a yellow jersey (I bet you''re fed up of people making that remark, sorry). Pretty good action shot though my personal preference would have been for a slower shutter speed to give more of an action impression, the desat works well. Good luck</td>', 'Shame it wasn''t a yellow jersey (I bet you''re fed up of people making that remark, sorry). Pretty good action shot though my personal preference would have been for a slower shutter speed to give more of an action impression, the desat works well. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690978, 516666, 60275, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. The desaturated arms take something away from it somehow.</td>', 'Lovely capture. The desaturated arms take something away from it somehow.', '2007-05-24 13:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690979, 516624, 78944, '<td valign="top">very nice. like the middle girls expression and the selective coloring is great. really makes the picture "pop."</td>', 'very nice. like the middle girls expression and the selective coloring is great. really makes the picture "pop."', '2007-05-24 13:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690985, 515064, 25024, '<td valign="top">Don''t think I want to meet him down a dark alley! Spookily done, I like the mist not to mention the axe, (phew I''m glad I didn''t mention the axe). Good luck</td>', 'Don''t think I want to meet him down a dark alley! Spookily done, I like the mist not to mention the axe, (phew I''m glad I didn''t mention the axe). Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3690999, 512792, 60275, '<td valign="top">This is a good, polished image.</td>', 'This is a good, polished image.', '2007-05-24 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691000, 515913, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s good, simple but has impact in the crop, exposure and viewpoint and the desat works well too. Good luck</td>', 'That''s good, simple but has impact in the crop, exposure and viewpoint and the desat works well too. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691013, 515402, 25024, '<td valign="top">I like that. Very well captured action and expressions of the crowd. The choice of and execution of the desat gives it impact, should do well, good luck</td>', 'I like that. Very well captured action and expressions of the crowd. The choice of and execution of the desat gives it impact, should do well, good luck', '2007-05-24 13:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691015, 516021, 60275, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. The gradually desaturated skin looks a bit weird though. Still, I understand why is like that.</td>', 'Nice picture. The gradually desaturated skin looks a bit weird though. Still, I understand why is like that.', '2007-05-24 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691023, 513810, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s good but I wish the shades reflections had been of a more interesting subject. I like everything else about the shot.</td>', 'That''s good but I wish the shades reflections had been of a more interesting subject. I like everything else about the shot.', '2007-05-24 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691035, 513695, 25024, '<td valign="top">One of the very few flower shots I have wanted to vote on. I like the simplicity of this shot, it''s stark graphic quality gives it impact. Good luck</td>', 'One of the very few flower shots I have wanted to vote on. I like the simplicity of this shot, it''s stark graphic quality gives it impact. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691045, 515559, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s some capture, well done. Shame it isn''t a little sharper but it sure is a frame filler and as for that eye... Good luck</td>', 'That''s some capture, well done. Shame it isn''t a little sharper but it sure is a frame filler and as for that eye... Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691048, 517082, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It''s a fun take on the challenge.  I do think it would be a tad stronger presentation if the ''Painter'' was in color also.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'I really like this.  It''s a fun take on the challenge.  I do think it would be a tad stronger presentation if the ''Painter'' was in color also.  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691050, 517023, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s an excellent action shot that has added impact form the grainy feel. Good choice of desat it all works well for me. Good luck</td>', 'That''s an excellent action shot that has added impact form the grainy feel. Good choice of desat it all works well for me. Good luck', '2007-05-24 13:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691052, 515906, 25024, '<td valign="top">Nearing the end of 500+ image trawl of flowers and eyes I thought I''d seen enough of them but tis is very special. Tremendous graphic quality and impact. Lovely pose and lighting I really do like this, you deserve to do well.</td>', 'Nearing the end of 500+ image trawl of flowers and eyes I thought I''d seen enough of them but tis is very special. Tremendous graphic quality and impact. Lovely pose and lighting I really do like this, you deserve to do well.', '2007-05-24 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691056, 513623, 30049, '<td valign="top">You put a lot of time and effort into this.  Looks nice.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'You put a lot of time and effort into this.  Looks nice.  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 13:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691059, 516475, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job of processing on this.  Very good job of getting that fairytale feel and look to it.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Wonderful job of processing on this.  Very good job of getting that fairytale feel and look to it.  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 13:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691064, 511966, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oops!  Missed the desat part of the challenge description?  Cool looking glass globe however.  :)  Good luck!<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Oops!  Missed the desat part of the challenge description?  Cool looking glass globe however.  :)  Good luck! BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 13:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691066, 516858, 25024, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred to see this more off-centre with the frame desat as well so that only the sepia print remained, just my opinion, hope you do well.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred to see this more off-centre with the frame desat as well so that only the sepia print remained, just my opinion, hope you do well.', '2007-05-24 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691069, 516055, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever use of desat here.  Nice.  The greyscale area could be a little richer in tonal range IMO (true white/true black).  Perhaps a touch more contrast also?  JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Clever use of desat here.  Nice.  The greyscale area could be a little richer in tonal range IMO (true white/true black).  Perhaps a touch more contrast also?  JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691071, 515346, 58610, '<td valign="top">Really nice.</td>', 'Really nice.', '2007-05-24 13:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691073, 515816, 25024, '<td valign="top">Yes, this works well for me. Great capture, well done</td>', 'Yes, this works well for me. Great capture, well done', '2007-05-24 13:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691074, 517002, 58610, '<td valign="top">Love the motion.</td>', 'Love the motion.', '2007-05-24 13:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691076, 514218, 60275, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Subtle desat.</td>', 'Great portrait. Subtle desat.', '2007-05-24 13:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691079, 513057, 58610, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus.</td>', 'Too out of focus.', '2007-05-24 13:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691083, 516757, 25024, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the better brolly shots! I like the desat and choice of colour and the light patch adds well to the figure''s contrast.</td>', 'Definitely one of the better brolly shots! I like the desat and choice of colour and the light patch adds well to the figure''s contrast.', '2007-05-24 13:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691085, 516048, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why so sad?  I like what you''ve done with the desat.  Works well.  This kind of photo is challenging in the sense that I can appreciate wanting to capture the emotion, but at the same time it makes me wonder when someone is obviously sad and distressed how can you take time to grab a camera instead of comforting the child?  Personally, I wouldn''t be able to take this photo.  Obviously, JMO.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Why so sad?  I like what you''ve done with the desat.  Works well.  This kind of photo is challenging in the sense that I can appreciate wanting to capture the emotion, but at the same time it makes me wonder when someone is obviously sad and distressed how can you take time to grab a camera instead of comforting the child?  Personally, I wouldn''t be able to take this photo.  Obviously, JMO.  :)  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 14:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691088, 513190, 58610, '<td valign="top">Highlights are a little blown, but otherwise, nice photo. I really would have liked it if her glasses were yellow, too.</td>', 'Highlights are a little blown, but otherwise, nice photo. I really would have liked it if her glasses were yellow, too.', '2007-05-24 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691091, 516864, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well titled and nicely done on the desat.  Must be interesting to watch one of these events.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Well titled and nicely done on the desat.  Must be interesting to watch one of these events.  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 14:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691097, 513367, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, funny, sad...the things we do for challenge entry photos, eh?  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Cute, funny, sad...the things we do for challenge entry photos, eh?  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 14:03:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3691101, 516402, 58610, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Did you consider having the crop just touch the top of his cap (like it touches his coat on both sides)? Just a thought.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Did you consider having the crop just touch the top of his cap (like it touches his coat on both sides)? Just a thought.', '2007-05-24 14:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691103, 514737, 25024, '<td valign="top">Action shot timing at it''s best and good choice of viewpoint. Good luck</td>', 'Action shot timing at it''s best and good choice of viewpoint. Good luck', '2007-05-24 14:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691107, 516676, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, fun, nice.  I like the creative path you took here for this challenge.  Almost wish there was just a bit more for the bg - almost too simple in a way.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Simple, fun, nice.  I like the creative path you took here for this challenge.  Almost wish there was just a bit more for the bg - almost too simple in a way.  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 14:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691111, 514481, 58610, '<td valign="top">Your burning and blurring left a halo around the subject. You might want to try a mask layer next time.</td>', 'Your burning and blurring left a halo around the subject. You might want to try a mask layer next time.', '2007-05-24 14:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691112, 515564, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, that''s good. I like everything about this, the pose, the crop, the letter and capture. You deserve to do well with this, good luck</td>', 'Hmmm, that''s good. I like everything about this, the pose, the crop, the letter and capture. You deserve to do well with this, good luck', '2007-05-24 14:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691117, 516537, 30049, '<td valign="top">The lightening of the clouds works well with the subject, although I have NO idea what the subject is.  :)  Looks like a big bobber!  Is it a marker of sorts (like a buoy) to warn boaters of the rocks?  Hmmm.  Good luck to you in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'The lightening of the clouds works well with the subject, although I have NO idea what the subject is.  :)  Looks like a big bobber!  Is it a marker of sorts (like a buoy) to warn boaters of the rocks?  Hmmm.  Good luck to you in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691126, 516401, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this (mostly).  The kayak is a fun subject for this photo.  The greyscale part isn''t working too well for me - I think the foliage is too light and the water should be darker.  Just seems off.  JMO of course.  Good luck.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'I like this (mostly).  The kayak is a fun subject for this photo.  The greyscale part isn''t working too well for me - I think the foliage is too light and the water should be darker.  Just seems off.  JMO of course.  Good luck. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 14:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691131, 514295, 58610, '<td valign="top">Its so wierd to see them with modern weapons and bayonettes. OK, I''ve stopped staring long enough to cast my vote. 9</td>', 'Its so wierd to see them with modern weapons and bayonettes. OK, I''ve stopped staring long enough to cast my vote. 9', '2007-05-24 14:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691132, 515488, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice expression</td>', 'nice expression', '2007-05-24 14:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691138, 516152, 29293, '<td valign="top">colfax marathon?</td>', 'colfax marathon?', '2007-05-24 14:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691139, 515131, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative idea.</td>', 'Very imaginative idea.', '2007-05-24 14:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691140, 513385, 25024, '<td valign="top">Yeh, cute. The desat works well, a little sharper focus would have given it more bite (excuse the pun). Good luck</td>', 'Yeh, cute. The desat works well, a little sharper focus would have given it more bite (excuse the pun). Good luck', '2007-05-24 14:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691141, 516329, 58610, '<td valign="top">Needs better lighting and focus.</td>', 'Needs better lighting and focus.', '2007-05-24 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691149, 511782, 58610, '<td valign="top">What an incredible bird.</td>', 'What an incredible bird.', '2007-05-24 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691151, 515915, 12268, '<td valign="top">Hilariuos! Poor Kenny!</td>', 'Hilariuos! Poor Kenny!', '2007-05-24 14:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691155, 512350, 58610, '<td valign="top">Indeed!</td>', 'Indeed!', '2007-05-24 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691159, 515488, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is intense! Love the compo, the look, the everything, 10! Good luck!</td>', 'This is intense! Love the compo, the look, the everything, 10! Good luck!', '2007-05-24 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691170, 516603, 60275, '<td valign="top">You don''t get a picture like this every day. 10</td>', 'You don''t get a picture like this every day. 10', '2007-05-24 14:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691171, 516430, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s good. The desat works well but it''s a shame those magnificent windows are not sharper and doing more for the whole image. Good luck</td>', 'That''s good. The desat works well but it''s a shame those magnificent windows are not sharper and doing more for the whole image. Good luck', '2007-05-24 14:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691175, 516834, 58610, '<td valign="top">We always want to blame her, don''t we? Your apple edges are a bit sharp. Try using a softer brush. Also, the blurring of the hands causes my eye to be distracted. Usually something shot on the same plane will have the same focus.</td>', 'We always want to blame her, don''t we? Your apple edges are a bit sharp. Try using a softer brush. Also, the blurring of the hands causes my eye to be distracted. Usually something shot on the same plane will have the same focus.', '2007-05-24 14:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691180, 517023, 58610, '<td valign="top">Well composed/cropped. Great expression.</td>', 'Well composed/cropped. Great expression.', '2007-05-24 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691186, 516676, 25024, '<td valign="top">That''s good. Good sharp focus, fairly interesting reflections and lovely colours. I think I would have liked to see a more interesting background though. Good luck</td>', 'That''s good. Good sharp focus, fairly interesting reflections and lovely colours. I think I would have liked to see a more interesting background though. Good luck', '2007-05-24 14:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691189, 516577, 58610, '<td valign="top">I like this. Another idea would be to have the flame lit along with the outside of the balloon, but the inside desat. That way the flame would stand out a little more.</td>', 'I like this. Another idea would be to have the flame lit along with the outside of the balloon, but the inside desat. That way the flame would stand out a little more.', '2007-05-24 14:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691196, 513349, 58610, '<td valign="top">I think too much has been colored. Over half the pic is in color, but my eye isn''t drawn to anything in particular.</td>', 'I think too much has been colored. Over half the pic is in color, but my eye isn''t drawn to anything in particular.', '2007-05-24 14:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691199, 516870, 58610, '<td valign="top">I would have chosen either one or the other, not both. I think the lower one.</td>', 'I would have chosen either one or the other, not both. I think the lower one.', '2007-05-24 14:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691203, 516783, 58610, '<td valign="top">Well, yeah! Nice composition. Pink lips would have really finished this.</td>', 'Well, yeah! Nice composition. Pink lips would have really finished this.', '2007-05-24 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691206, 516440, 58610, '<td valign="top">Why?</td>', 'Why?', '2007-05-24 14:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691214, 516365, 58610, '<td valign="top">Windy? Nice composition. Needs better focus.</td>', 'Windy? Nice composition. Needs better focus.', '2007-05-24 14:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691217, 515708, 58610, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Creative idea. Nicely composed.', '2007-05-24 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691257, 516992, 30049, '<td valign="top">The shoes are certainly ''Retro''.  It''s fun to watch fashions cycle back around.  :)  As for the photo I like your choice of subject.  The location would have been better suited on some blacktop IMO.  The composition/focus/lighting, etc...are all in good order.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'The shoes are certainly ''Retro''.  It''s fun to watch fashions cycle back around.  :)  As for the photo I like your choice of subject.  The location would have been better suited on some blacktop IMO.  The composition/focus/lighting, etc...are all in good order.  Best of luck to you in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 15:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691260, 516927, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good placement of your subject in relation to the bg - nice bokeh effect.  Nice job of doing the selective desat on a tricky item (hair!).  :)  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Good placement of your subject in relation to the bg - nice bokeh effect.  Nice job of doing the selective desat on a tricky item (hair!).  :)  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 15:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691262, 516675, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines and good use of selective desat for this.  Vignetting is a nice touch.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice leading lines and good use of selective desat for this.  Vignetting is a nice touch.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-24 15:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691264, 516568, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this shot and it''s a good choice for desat.  The haloing around the woman is a little distracting.  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>ETA - No worries about scoring.  I''m just commenting.  :)</td>', 'I like the feel of this shot and it''s a good choice for desat.  The haloing around the woman is a little distracting.  Good luck in the challenge. ETA - No worries about scoring.  I''m just commenting.  :)', '2007-05-24 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691265, 516852, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Nice job on the desat part.  Subject matter and composition is a bit static and IMO not very exciting to look at.  Nothing personal, just an opinion.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Ok.  Nice job on the desat part.  Subject matter and composition is a bit static and IMO not very exciting to look at.  Nothing personal, just an opinion.  :)  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 15:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691271, 517046, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very clean and sharp work on the main subject.  The burn tool is a bit obvious, not too over-the-top or anything, just not that subtle.  Haven''t decided if I like the wide-angle view or not...would be nice to see more of the main subject I think and move him off-center a little.  All JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.<br/> <br/>BTW - Commenting only, not voting.</td>', 'Very clean and sharp work on the main subject.  The burn tool is a bit obvious, not too over-the-top or anything, just not that subtle.  Haven''t decided if I like the wide-angle view or not...would be nice to see more of the main subject I think and move him off-center a little.  All JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge. BTW - Commenting only, not voting.', '2007-05-24 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
