(3696352, 516430, 20330, '<td valign="top">the subtle colors and soft touch of this image is exceptional, the colored panes are shaped as arrows all pointing to the center of the image, the dome, which leads the eye back to the panes with its desat.. its truly a lovely image.. i hope others *get it*. 9</td>', 'the subtle colors and soft touch of this image is exceptional, the colored panes are shaped as arrows all pointing to the center of the image, the dome, which leads the eye back to the panes with its desat.. its truly a lovely image.. i hope others *get it*. 9', '2007-05-25 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696361, 516271, 20330, '<td valign="top">i assume this is infared? I dont know much about it.. but the whiteness of this image has that look. its a nice detailed image, the colors of the eyes are beautiful, and the little pouty nose is so cute!!</td>', 'i assume this is infared? I dont know much about it.. but the whiteness of this image has that look. its a nice detailed image, the colors of the eyes are beautiful, and the little pouty nose is so cute!!', '2007-05-25 23:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696374, 514730, 20330, '<td valign="top">i see this and i think of a man who has lost his wife.. he holds her wedding ring.. the title and the image force the viewer to compose a story in their head, and thats a wonderful thing for an image to do. techinically this is well done, the editing is beautiful and i can''t imagine this being as powerful in full color or full b/w... its a perfect use of desat. hope you get a ribbon. 10</td>', 'i see this and i think of a man who has lost his wife.. he holds her wedding ring.. the title and the image force the viewer to compose a story in their head, and thats a wonderful thing for an image to do. techinically this is well done, the editing is beautiful and i can''t imagine this being as powerful in full color or full b/w... its a perfect use of desat. hope you get a ribbon. 10', '2007-05-25 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
