(3697480, 517048, 72317, '<td valign="top">If he''s in a crowd, how is he alone?<br/>The image is very grainy and noisy.<br/>I can see some of your black and white seeping onto the rings, and this looks like another case where things were put in color just for the heck of it. If you had put the man completely in color, it would have been different.</td>', 'If he''s in a crowd, how is he alone?The image is very grainy and noisy.I can see some of your black and white seeping onto the rings, and this looks like another case where things were put in color just for the heck of it. If you had put the man completely in color, it would have been different.', '2007-05-26 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697484, 515230, 72317, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to comment on the fact that you took a picture of some tiles rather than on something else. If you constructed this bird, then good job, but stick to traditional means of photography.<br/>If someone else constructed this bird, I sure hope you''re crediting them somehow in the image details..<br/> <br/>The only reason I don''t like it is because it''s a picture of a picture. It just doesn''t seem very original to me.</td>', 'I''ll have to comment on the fact that you took a picture of some tiles rather than on something else. If you constructed this bird, then good job, but stick to traditional means of photography.If someone else constructed this bird, I sure hope you''re crediting them somehow in the image details.. The only reason I don''t like it is because it''s a picture of a picture. It just doesn''t seem very original to me.', '2007-05-26 12:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697486, 515803, 78196, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! Simple and effective. Wish I could vote!</td>', 'Fantastic shot! Simple and effective. Wish I could vote!', '2007-05-26 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
