(3697683, 516178, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool photograph.  I love the long shadows.  I don''t even mind the slightly blurred main subject -- this has the feel of a very old photograph with a hand-tinted subject.  I''d like it even more if the motorcycle more to the right (entering the frame), but it does have the feel of speed.</td>', 'This is such a cool photograph.  I love the long shadows.  I don''t even mind the slightly blurred main subject -- this has the feel of a very old photograph with a hand-tinted subject.  I''d like it even more if the motorcycle more to the right (entering the frame), but it does have the feel of speed.', '2007-05-26 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697687, 513623, 67697, '<td valign="top">Pretty and dreamy...</td>', 'Pretty and dreamy...', '2007-05-26 13:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697692, 516788, 67697, '<td valign="top">Precious - she''s adorable and looks great standing apart from the background by being in color.  Love the three daisies as well.</td>', 'Precious - she''s adorable and looks great standing apart from the background by being in color.  Love the three daisies as well.', '2007-05-26 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3697696, 515049, 59925, '<td valign="top">I''m drawn to the guy behind the shopper. Looks like trouble.  Hold on to those bags! I like this alot.  Spent more time contemplating this than others.</td>', 'I''m drawn to the guy behind the shopper. Looks like trouble.  Hold on to those bags! I like this alot.  Spent more time contemplating this than others.', '2007-05-26 13:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
