(3697999, 515785, 33400, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and I think you''ve done a pretty good jod depicting the "grass is greener on the other side" concept.  My only nit-pick is that the background area to the far left side is obviously part of this "other side" and it''s not green.  Mybe a different crop to only show the tunnel view of that area would have been more clear.<br/>Please feel free to take me with a grain of salt.  I''m still learning this venue.</td>', 'I like the idea, and I think you''ve done a pretty good jod depicting the "grass is greener on the other side" concept.  My only nit-pick is that the background area to the far left side is obviously part of this "other side" and it''s not green.  Mybe a different crop to only show the tunnel view of that area would have been more clear.Please feel free to take me with a grain of salt.  I''m still learning this venue.', '2007-05-26 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3698003, 516370, 74534, '<td valign="top">The seeds are over-sharpened, as you can see from the white halos around them...</td>', 'The seeds are over-sharpened, as you can see from the white halos around them...', '2007-05-26 16:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
