(3698006, 514822, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot over the St. John''s River.<br/>I grew up in Jacksonville, and actually got my first job in that Modis building (It was Independent Life Insurance Company at the time.)<br/>Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'Very nice shot over the St. John''s River.I grew up in Jacksonville, and actually got my first job in that Modis building (It was Independent Life Insurance Company at the time.)Good luck in the challenge', '2007-05-26 16:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
