(3698194, 517009, 66494, '<td valign="top">Love the fact that you chose only to keep color in the reflection. Nice choice, nice PP.  9</td>', 'Love the fact that you chose only to keep color in the reflection. Nice choice, nice PP.  9', '2007-05-26 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
