(3698205, 511919, 66494, '<td valign="top">After seeing many that over did the color by making it way too stark ... your color is almost perfect and very soothing too. 8</td>', 'After seeing many that over did the color by making it way too stark ... your color is almost perfect and very soothing too. 8', '2007-05-26 18:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
