(3698215, 516741, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, and I like your selective desaturation.  I can some random pink streaks here and there on her skin -- face and shoulder especially.  It''s hard to tell with the mask, but my first impression is that the model isn''t trilled to be posing. :-}</td>', 'Beautifully lit, and I like your selective desaturation.  I can some random pink streaks here and there on her skin -- face and shoulder especially.  It''s hard to tell with the mask, but my first impression is that the model isn''t trilled to be posing. :-}', '2007-05-26 18:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3698219, 516770, 61961, '<td valign="top">Good PP work, especially considering the detail.</td>', 'Good PP work, especially considering the detail.', '2007-05-26 18:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
