(3702299, 516164, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little girl.  I''m having trouble with this one because I really think the shot would be better with NO color (which of course would make it DNMC).  The colorful flowers keep pulling me away from her whimsical expression, which I think should be the focal point.<br/>You also have a little problem with color shadowing the area around the flowers - I presume from the way you selected that area. You may get dinged overall for that.  But don''t let it bother you, this is a great photo (exceptions noted) and you should be pleased with it.</td>', 'Beautiful little girl.  I''m having trouble with this one because I really think the shot would be better with NO color (which of course would make it DNMC).  The colorful flowers keep pulling me away from her whimsical expression, which I think should be the focal point.You also have a little problem with color shadowing the area around the flowers - I presume from the way you selected that area. You may get dinged overall for that.  But don''t let it bother you, this is a great photo (exceptions noted) and you should be pleased with it.', '2007-05-28 00:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
