(3702478, 517012, 32786, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Snake:</b></div><hr/><i> I raised you to a 5 but despite the color I dont really like the shot You should have moved the stem from above the F*****-newt, mabey croped it.  It might have made a nice macro from a different angle sorry not for me.  Oh you could have sharpened the image a little more.  No composition!  Have a good day.  I had a F Newt once that love to ride in the car she would sit in my back window when I drove around. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree this pictures sucks the big one it is out of focus and the comp is crappy. I just wanted to hear you say that not because the newt color wasn''t right.  I did about 6 diffrent pics for this challenge and I was doin alittle drinkin and I put up  a really bad picture.</td>', 'Originally posted by Snake: I raised you to a 5 but despite the color I dont really like the shot You should have moved the stem from above the F*****-newt, mabey croped it.  It might have made a nice macro from a different angle sorry not for me.  Oh you could have sharpened the image a little more.  No composition!  Have a good day.  I had a F Newt once that love to ride in the car she would sit in my back window when I drove around.   I agree this pictures sucks the big one it is out of focus and the comp is crappy. I just wanted to hear you say that not because the newt color wasn''t right.  I did about 6 diffrent pics for this challenge and I was doin alittle drinkin and I put up  a really bad picture.', '2007-05-28 01:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
