(3703062, 515914, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love Roger''s comment.  :-)  Dang fine looking horse, by the way.  I think the horse under the neck made for a slightly awkward composition, and hay, like grass and stuff, is really hard to shoot without it looking either mushy or oversharpened.  I do like the angle.</td>', 'I love Roger''s comment.  :-)  Dang fine looking horse, by the way.  I think the horse under the neck made for a slightly awkward composition, and hay, like grass and stuff, is really hard to shoot without it looking either mushy or oversharpened.  I do like the angle.', '2007-05-28 02:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703063, 516445, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this.   It''s so simple -- but that''s why the red pop makes it so striking and appealing.   Great job.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like this.   It''s so simple -- but that''s why the red pop makes it so striking and appealing.   Great job. ', '2007-05-28 02:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
