(3703074, 516783, 17148, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/>I really like how sharp and bright the bra is. Everything else seems a bit too soft. Did you use a program to take away noise, cause it looks like you did a tad too much. I don''t think this jacket was a good choice because you loose texture and all you can see is pure black. The lighting on the bra and skin looks to be good.</td>', ':: Critique Club :: I really like how sharp and bright the bra is. Everything else seems a bit too soft. Did you use a program to take away noise, cause it looks like you did a tad too much. I don''t think this jacket was a good choice because you loose texture and all you can see is pure black. The lighting on the bra and skin looks to be good.', '2007-05-28 02:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
