(3703088, 514788, 66384, '<td valign="top">Eleventh! Aarg, so close. You deserved a star on this shot. It''s marvelous. I would never have thought of using selective desat on this photo, because the peacock colors are so wonderful, I''d hate to lose any of them. But this really works. Congratulations.</td>', 'Eleventh! Aarg, so close. You deserved a star on this shot. It''s marvelous. I would never have thought of using selective desat on this photo, because the peacock colors are so wonderful, I''d hate to lose any of them. But this really works. Congratulations.', '2007-05-28 02:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703092, 516961, 17148, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/>First off without reading your comments I have no idea what he is doing or what he is preparing for, what his part might be in the wedding. I think the song book could have been taken out of the shot, which seems to take your eyes away to read what it says. I think this shot would have worked better at a different angle to where you can see he has a guitar and show more seats, seeing that he is there all by himself.</td>', ':: Critique Club :: First off without reading your comments I have no idea what he is doing or what he is preparing for, what his part might be in the wedding. I think the song book could have been taken out of the shot, which seems to take your eyes away to read what it says. I think this shot would have worked better at a different angle to where you can see he has a guitar and show more seats, seeing that he is there all by himself.', '2007-05-28 02:46:44.000000', NULL, 0),
