(3703204, 516030, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is really quite a gorgeous shot!  I love the textures in the backgound and really love the color of the violin.  Excellent processing on it - you <i>should</i> be proud of it!</td>', 'This is really quite a gorgeous shot!  I love the textures in the backgound and really love the color of the violin.  Excellent processing on it - you should be proud of it!', '2007-05-28 03:15:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703208, 516388, 70, '<td valign="top">Robbed of the brown by a professional! Ah well. <br/> <br/>So, what''s the deal...are we missing something or were you? ;)</td>', 'Robbed of the brown by a professional! Ah well.  So, what''s the deal...are we missing something or were you? ;)', '2007-05-28 03:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703210, 516681, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wickedly underrated, Svetlana.  I was quite taken with this one.</td>', 'Wickedly underrated, Svetlana.  I was quite taken with this one.', '2007-05-28 03:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703211, 516885, 50641, '<td valign="top">there''s my gracie :)</td>', 'there''s my gracie :)', '2007-05-28 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703215, 516159, 30982, '<td valign="top">The shadows from the balloons are my favorite part of this.  I thought this was Shannylee''s when I first saw it.  Excellent shot with high sun - everyone talks about "magic light" and all, but this is a great example of how to use mid-day sun.  You do very good, very creative work!</td>', 'The shadows from the balloons are my favorite part of this.  I thought this was Shannylee''s when I first saw it.  Excellent shot with high sun - everyone talks about "magic light" and all, but this is a great example of how to use mid-day sun.  You do very good, very creative work!', '2007-05-28 03:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703216, 516170, 76184, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by thegrandwazoo:</b></div><hr/><i> DUDE and you gave me a lecture...<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>heh, yeah, I took that shot during a rifle match. The "model" is actually a competitor...and was actually shooting at the time, thus no rules were broken. ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by thegrandwazoo: DUDE and you gave me a lecture...  heh, yeah, I took that shot during a rifle match. The "model" is actually a competitor...and was actually shooting at the time, thus no rules were broken. ;)', '2007-05-28 03:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703221, 515493, 30982, '<td valign="top">The use of desat here to bring out his colors is very good.  I think the composition might have been a bit stronger had it been closer to a square crop, putting his face and eyes on a thirds section.</td>', 'The use of desat here to bring out his colors is very good.  I think the composition might have been a bit stronger had it been closer to a square crop, putting his face and eyes on a thirds section.', '2007-05-28 03:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703224, 517000, 45475, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a really good use of desat. FWIW I think it''s underrated. Nice work :)</td>', 'I thought this was a really good use of desat. FWIW I think it''s underrated. Nice work :)', '2007-05-28 03:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703226, 515685, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your efforts paid off - very good execution for this challenge - simple, to the point, and the desat works for the point you''re making.  I am indeed surprised you managed to get off a shot without people in it at Huntington Beach!</td>', 'Your efforts paid off - very good execution for this challenge - simple, to the point, and the desat works for the point you''re making.  I am indeed surprised you managed to get off a shot without people in it at Huntington Beach!', '2007-05-28 03:21:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703230, 516302, 45475, '<td valign="top">Pulls at the heartstrings. Well, it did for me anyway. Maybe if the flower colour was stronger, it would have had more impact??</td>', 'Pulls at the heartstrings. Well, it did for me anyway. Maybe if the flower colour was stronger, it would have had more impact??', '2007-05-28 03:22:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703231, 516573, 30982, '<td valign="top">Way below what I scored it.  I love the title and I love the soft, gentle look you captured from the bunny.  Excellent, subtle desat very well done.</td>', 'Way below what I scored it.  I love the title and I love the soft, gentle look you captured from the bunny.  Excellent, subtle desat very well done.', '2007-05-28 03:23:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703232, 516405, 30982, '<td valign="top">It is indeed a striking wall - and the desat technique serves this well to emphasize it!</td>', 'It is indeed a striking wall - and the desat technique serves this well to emphasize it!', '2007-05-28 03:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703234, 516299, 45475, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh... I thought this was lovely. Great muted tone in the flower. Well done!</td>', 'Ohhhh... I thought this was lovely. Great muted tone in the flower. Well done!', '2007-05-28 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703236, 514174, 30982, '<td valign="top">Huh??  I do NOT get that score at all.  I swear, I have no clue when it comes to this place sometimes.  I quite like this.  Soft, gentle, and I like the partial desat on the background hearts.</td>', 'Huh??  I do NOT get that score at all.  I swear, I have no clue when it comes to this place sometimes.  I quite like this.  Soft, gentle, and I like the partial desat on the background hearts.', '2007-05-28 03:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
