(3703243, 512513, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent work on the desat!  That must have taken a bit of time, and the end result is worth it - this is one of those shots where I do believe the desat actually benefits the picture nicely.  Score should have been higher in my estimation (and you''re commenters thought so, too.)  Congrats on a great picture!</td>', 'Excellent work on the desat!  That must have taken a bit of time, and the end result is worth it - this is one of those shots where I do believe the desat actually benefits the picture nicely.  Score should have been higher in my estimation (and you''re commenters thought so, too.)  Congrats on a great picture!', '2007-05-28 03:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703249, 516973, 48954, '<td valign="top">how is god''s name do you come up with this stuff? Good work.</td>', 'how is god''s name do you come up with this stuff? Good work.', '2007-05-28 03:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
