(3703325, 516118, 53814, '<td valign="top">You are very observant to have discovered the hidden four-legged creature lurking in the original color version of this photograph. It seems that even the overly-saturated blue was not enough to reveal the creature''s existance to many of the voters. Maybe the voters, like Jean, were engrossed in a good book and could not be concerned by trivial monsters.</td>', 'You are very observant to have discovered the hidden four-legged creature lurking in the original color version of this photograph. It seems that even the overly-saturated blue was not enough to reveal the creature''s existance to many of the voters. Maybe the voters, like Jean, were engrossed in a good book and could not be concerned by trivial monsters.', '2007-05-28 03:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703328, 514272, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Rob!  Nice choice for the challenge - the desat isn''t overpowering and definitely serves to highlight your subject nicely.</td>', 'Great shot, Rob!  Nice choice for the challenge - the desat isn''t overpowering and definitely serves to highlight your subject nicely.', '2007-05-28 03:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703332, 516018, 51793, '<td valign="top">Awww you''re so very welcome for the comment. I really did love this shot. I wish it would have taken something higher up on the page (like 1,2 or 3 but hey a top ten??? I mean that''s gold in my eyes already. I really do just love this picture. BTW I hope you don''t mind me trying it someday. I need to get my new camera first because the one I have now doesn''t hit F/16 so  it will be a while. <br/> <br/>Again your most welcome for the comment, and the FAV. I hope you upload a beautiful print for this. I''m sure that someone would want it. <br/> <br/>&lt;----- ME. Anyway, Wonderful job and Congrats on you''re top 10.</td>', 'Awww you''re so very welcome for the comment. I really did love this shot. I wish it would have taken something higher up on the page (like 1,2 or 3 but hey a top ten??? I mean that''s gold in my eyes already. I really do just love this picture. BTW I hope you don''t mind me trying it someday. I need to get my new camera first because the one I have now doesn''t hit F/16 so  it will be a while.  Again your most welcome for the comment, and the FAV. I hope you upload a beautiful print for this. I''m sure that someone would want it.  <----- ME. Anyway, Wonderful job and Congrats on you''re top 10.', '2007-05-28 03:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703338, 513622, 67258, '<td valign="top">Judi, I am really suprised that this didn''t come much, much higher in the rankings.  I absolutely love it; the high key exposure is spot on, and the lovely subtle colourations compliment the model and pose beautifully.</td>', 'Judi, I am really suprised that this didn''t come much, much higher in the rankings.  I absolutely love it; the high key exposure is spot on, and the lovely subtle colourations compliment the model and pose beautifully.', '2007-05-28 03:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703343, 516973, 62815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo,your imagination is far away from ours...Man can your team submit only 2 or 3 photos this week ? Only then we will have the chance to be close to you:)</td>', 'Wonderful photo,your imagination is far away from ours...Man can your team submit only 2 or 3 photos this week ? Only then we will have the chance to be close to you:)', '2007-05-28 04:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3703371, 517071, 67258, '<td valign="top">I had expected to see this rank much higher - you have captured a very evocatively dream-like image, as though looking back at childhood from a very, very long way away.  You may missed the mark with the bulk of the voters, but you connected with me</td>', 'I had expected to see this rank much higher - you have captured a very evocatively dream-like image, as though looking back at childhood from a very, very long way away.  You may missed the mark with the bulk of the voters, but you connected with me', '2007-05-28 04:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
