(3703570, 516715, 67145, '<td valign="top">i think this is excellent .. in fact since i first viewed it it has grown on me heaps .. i think that a lot of voters dont spend 2 seconds viewing an image ... its like a one second glance and then a vote .. i cant see how 1 second could ever give any image the time it deserves .. i''ve often opened an image and thought ''wotever'' .. i''ve then looked some more and started to get a bit impressed .. by the time i''m ready to vote i''m thinking wow .. i reckon this is worth more than 5.0085, but wot do i know .. my first entry in a challenge for a month is now at 5.1... i had an hour to take the photograph and process it and then get it submitted into dpc .. rushing for me is never a good thing &amp; i wouldnt have entered it at all, if i wasnt in the team .. i was sort''v hoping that the voters''d surprise me .. well they havent!!!!!!!!.. :):)xxxxx</td>', 'i think this is excellent .. in fact since i first viewed it it has grown on me heaps .. i think that a lot of voters dont spend 2 seconds viewing an image ... its like a one second glance and then a vote .. i cant see how 1 second could ever give any image the time it deserves .. i''ve often opened an image and thought ''wotever'' .. i''ve then looked some more and started to get a bit impressed .. by the time i''m ready to vote i''m thinking wow .. i reckon this is worth more than 5.0085, but wot do i know .. my first entry in a challenge for a month is now at 5.1... i had an hour to take the photograph and process it and then get it submitted into dpc .. rushing for me is never a good thing & i wouldnt have entered it at all, if i wasnt in the team .. i was sort''v hoping that the voters''d surprise me .. well they havent!!!!!!!!.. :):)xxxxx', '2007-05-28 07:02:43.000000', NULL, 0),
