(3703617, 515854, 57060, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for their voting and comments. I wanted to add a note to those that questioned the fact that I didn''t colorize the rope. I thought long and hard on this, looked at both versions and left it like this - I didn''t want the rope to distract and pull people out of the picture. It doesn''t really add anything on the edges anyway - but oh well, can''t please everyone. Many great shots in this challenge, congrats to all the top ten and ribboners, <br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Thanks everyone for their voting and comments. I wanted to add a note to those that questioned the fact that I didn''t colorize the rope. I thought long and hard on this, looked at both versions and left it like this - I didn''t want the rope to distract and pull people out of the picture. It doesn''t really add anything on the edges anyway - but oh well, can''t please everyone. Many great shots in this challenge, congrats to all the top ten and ribboners,  Jack', '2007-05-28 07:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
