(3703697, 513268, 15810, '<td valign="top">The interesting / problem with this shot is that the focus is very clearly the Buoy due to the selective desaturation. I''d try posting the colour version (or fully B&amp;W) version and I''ll bet it''s a much better shot. I know it''s the tile of your photo but it just seems a bit odd. IMHO of course.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-28 07:26:14.</i></td>', 'The interesting / problem with this shot is that the focus is very clearly the Buoy due to the selective desaturation. I''d try posting the colour version (or fully B&W) version and I''ll bet it''s a much better shot. I know it''s the tile of your photo but it just seems a bit odd. IMHO of course.', '2007-05-28 08:24:51.000000', '2007-05-28 08:26:14.000000', 0),
