(3704504, 516885, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like your processing a lot on this shot. The composition bothers me a little, because the red line leads my eye down and off the page. I understand it is leading to the unseen ''master'', but it still feels uncomfortable. I think this was an excellent example of good selective desat. The color is great, and I like the b&amp;w tones.</td>', 'I like your processing a lot on this shot. The composition bothers me a little, because the red line leads my eye down and off the page. I understand it is leading to the unseen ''master'', but it still feels uncomfortable. I think this was an excellent example of good selective desat. The color is great, and I like the b&w tones.', '2007-05-28 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 0),
