(3704527, 516415, 59925, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TooCool:</b></div><hr/><i> Why?  I don''t get your choice of this shot for a desat challenge.  Having the one girl in color don''t make sense to me.  Why her and not one of the others...<br/>TC </i></td></tr></table> <br/>1.  I thought she was the cutest.<br/>2.  She''s the only one with her feet off the ground.<br/>3.  She''s my daughter.</td>', 'Originally posted by TooCool: Why?  I don''t get your choice of this shot for a desat challenge.  Having the one girl in color don''t make sense to me.  Why her and not one of the others...TC  1.  I thought she was the cutest.2.  She''s the only one with her feet off the ground.3.  She''s my daughter.', '2007-05-28 12:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
