(3704728, 513371, 70484, '<td valign="top">Hey their score double! I can''t believe that our bleeding heart scores are almost exactly the same! I love how you got the color to pop here. Mine was real soft and that was one of my comments. next time I will make it pop (and probably won''t use flowers, they don''t seem to like them at all :-)<br/> <br/>Well, at least I learned selective coloring!</td>', 'Hey their score double! I can''t believe that our bleeding heart scores are almost exactly the same! I love how you got the color to pop here. Mine was real soft and that was one of my comments. next time I will make it pop (and probably won''t use flowers, they don''t seem to like them at all :-) Well, at least I learned selective coloring!', '2007-05-28 13:07:55.000000', NULL, 0),
