(3704806, 516768, 74534, '<td valign="top">Well, a combination of a street photo with selective desat. I really like the feel of this kind of street photos, so was happy to find one that worked well with some color. However, I knew going in that such an image needs to really grab your eye in order to do well.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the good comments, I am happy to have received a 10 and also a fav!</td>', 'Well, a combination of a street photo with selective desat. I really like the feel of this kind of street photos, so was happy to find one that worked well with some color. However, I knew going in that such an image needs to really grab your eye in order to do well. Thanks for the good comments, I am happy to have received a 10 and also a fav!', '2007-05-28 13:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
