(3704862, 512884, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 during the challenge.  I thought the colors were quite striking.  The catch was amazing too!  I liked the added touch of the color on the nail heads.</td>', 'I gave this a 7 during the challenge.  I thought the colors were quite striking.  The catch was amazing too!  I liked the added touch of the color on the nail heads.', '2007-05-28 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 0),
