(3706841, 516370, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think the three comments you got during voting were very valid, and summed up the shot quite well. The first one praised it, as it deserves. The second one pointed out a minor problem with the desat. And the third one pointed out the over-sharpening, which I think is the most significant problem.<br/> <br/>I love the lily, and I think the b&amp;w conversion is excellent. I love the way the pistils and stamen (if those are the correct terms) pop right out of the image. I noticed the haloing, and thought ''too bad, you didn''t catch that'', because it is easy to fix with Advanced Rules.</td>', 'I think the three comments you got during voting were very valid, and summed up the shot quite well. The first one praised it, as it deserves. The second one pointed out a minor problem with the desat. And the third one pointed out the over-sharpening, which I think is the most significant problem. I love the lily, and I think the b&w conversion is excellent. I love the way the pistils and stamen (if those are the correct terms) pop right out of the image. I noticed the haloing, and thought ''too bad, you didn''t catch that'', because it is easy to fix with Advanced Rules.', '2007-05-29 00:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3706890, 516973, 22734, '<td valign="top">Jorge: What an amazing batting average! Out of 29 challenges: 8 ribbons and 5 near hits into paydirt. You are certainly extremely talented with a very wide gamut of outstanding images. Your port is most fascinating. With Nemo you showed how a vision can be executed by merging the talents of others with yours. Fantastic and a great visual. Congratulations on your well earned BLUE!</td>', 'Jorge: What an amazing batting average! Out of 29 challenges: 8 ribbons and 5 near hits into paydirt. You are certainly extremely talented with a very wide gamut of outstanding images. Your port is most fascinating. With Nemo you showed how a vision can be executed by merging the talents of others with yours. Fantastic and a great visual. Congratulations on your well earned BLUE!', '2007-05-29 00:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
