(3717229, 516153, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> I think it would be a tad stronger if you had left the non-liquid part of the glass in grayscale (stem and uppper glass above the liquid). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>But then it would look like pee...</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: I think it would be a tad stronger if you had left the non-liquid part of the glass in grayscale (stem and uppper glass above the liquid).   But then it would look like pee...', '2007-05-30 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
