(3718894, 513476, 32133, '<td valign="top">As far as the background, imo the pots are ok, maybe would be better if something were in them.  The wire rack is a real distraction. Other than that I actually really like the image.  The lighting and the wood tones of the chair relay a very warm feeling.<br/> <br/>I also wanted to add that I think given the competition in this challenge that the score seems fair.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-31 09:58:53.</i></td>', 'As far as the background, imo the pots are ok, maybe would be better if something were in them.  The wire rack is a real distraction. Other than that I actually really like the image.  The lighting and the wood tones of the chair relay a very warm feeling. I also wanted to add that I think given the competition in this challenge that the score seems fair.', '2007-05-31 10:54:41.000000', '2007-05-31 10:58:53.000000', 0),
(3718957, 513476, 54228, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is a great shot, should have scored better, but alas, there were many entries in this challenge. <br/> <br/>I really like the concept and the use of desat. The only thing that bugs me, as most have said is the composition. For me the frame is just a tad too busy, if you could have moved some of the items in the background, perhaps included the weatherboards as a stronger element (ala leading lines) and maybe an old window or something in the mix. <br/> <br/>However, congrats on a great capture regardless.</td>', 'In my opinion this is a great shot, should have scored better, but alas, there were many entries in this challenge.  I really like the concept and the use of desat. The only thing that bugs me, as most have said is the composition. For me the frame is just a tad too busy, if you could have moved some of the items in the background, perhaps included the weatherboards as a stronger element (ala leading lines) and maybe an old window or something in the mix.  However, congrats on a great capture regardless.', '2007-05-31 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3718973, 517029, 70661, '<td valign="top">Ummm...I love this. I was one of the two 10''s you received. I actually like the color of the shell the way it is. I like it better then the re-edit. :)</td>', 'Ummm...I love this. I was one of the two 10''s you received. I actually like the color of the shell the way it is. I like it better then the re-edit. :)', '2007-05-31 11:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3719101, 514432, 63269, '<td valign="top">I thought this would be in the top ten, at the very least! It certainly deserved to be... :) Ah well. Beautiful, striking shot.</td>', 'I thought this would be in the top ten, at the very least! It certainly deserved to be... :) Ah well. Beautiful, striking shot.', '2007-05-31 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 0),
