(3719139, 516180, 63269, '<td valign="top">Why on earth did this get dumped in the 5.9''s? The moment I laid eyes on this during the voting, I just <i>knew</i> it would ribbon. And then....? I thought this was exactly what the voters liked. Kind of like this image: <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=373461" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/531/thumb/373461.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/531/thumb/373461.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/531/thumb/373461.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Apparantly not... Oh well. :) Personally I think it''s a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Why on earth did this get dumped in the 5.9''s? The moment I laid eyes on this during the voting, I just knew it would ribbon. And then....? I thought this was exactly what the voters liked. Kind of like this image:   Apparantly not... Oh well. :) Personally I think it''s a wonderful shot.', '2007-05-31 12:29:08.000000', NULL, 0),
