(3722316, 515811, 50641, '<td valign="top">8 from me.  she is a classic and what an interesting milieu!</td>', '8 from me.  she is a classic and what an interesting milieu!', '2007-06-01 03:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722625, 516380, 27133, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club.</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> I like the layout here....the selective colour makes the subject come right out.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> Focus is good.  The blown out area on the top right is distracting and may have cost you points.<br/> <br/><b>Overall:</b>  I know this is a wild subject...and the voters may have felt the cluttered area was the problem.  Maybe try a lower down and closer angle...!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Composition: I like the layout here....the selective colour makes the subject come right out. Technical: Focus is good.  The blown out area on the top right is distracting and may have cost you points. Overall:  I know this is a wild subject...and the voters may have felt the cluttered area was the problem.  Maybe try a lower down and closer angle...!', '2007-06-01 06:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722632, 514931, 27133, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club.</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> The composition is your major let down here.  You have cropped harshly over the tyre and left a vacant area on the right of the image making the bike point out of the image instead of the preferred into the image.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> Focus and tones are good and the selective desaturation is selective but on topic.<br/> <br/><b>Overall:</b>Try a lower angle and maybe from a different point of view for more points.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Composition: The composition is your major let down here.  You have cropped harshly over the tyre and left a vacant area on the right of the image making the bike point out of the image instead of the preferred into the image. Technical: Focus and tones are good and the selective desaturation is selective but on topic. Overall:Try a lower angle and maybe from a different point of view for more points.', '2007-06-01 06:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722637, 516691, 27133, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club.</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> The central aspect but controlling of the viewers attention is well done.  The eye branches out from the center well.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> This is the area that has let you down.  Selective Desaturation was not meant to intend for colour to be over the entire or majority of the image.  I feel if the flower surrounds was left in BW then your score would have benefited.<br/> <br/><b>Overall:</b>  Try re-editing for a more flattering image.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Composition: The central aspect but controlling of the viewers attention is well done.  The eye branches out from the center well. Technical: This is the area that has let you down.  Selective Desaturation was not meant to intend for colour to be over the entire or majority of the image.  I feel if the flower surrounds was left in BW then your score would have benefited. Overall:  Try re-editing for a more flattering image.', '2007-06-01 06:49:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722639, 516048, 27133, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club.</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> The composition here is great.  No improvements there.  The subject is even looking back into the image.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> The heavy contrast/grunge feel is well suited.  The over saturation of the eyes has been your downfall...it looks over done and affects your image negatively.<br/> <br/><b>Overall:</b>  I would like to see this in straight BW just like the majority of your image already is.  This image did not need to have any form of colour for the story to be told.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Composition: The composition here is great.  No improvements there.  The subject is even looking back into the image. Technical: The heavy contrast/grunge feel is well suited.  The over saturation of the eyes has been your downfall...it looks over done and affects your image negatively. Overall:  I would like to see this in straight BW just like the majority of your image already is.  This image did not need to have any form of colour for the story to be told.', '2007-06-01 06:52:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722665, 514737, 27133, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club.</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> I really like this image.  The composition is great and the movement of the ball excellent.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> The choice of desaturation is spot on...the fluoro colour really works well.<br/> <br/><b>Overall:</b> The only thing I can put my finger on is the calibration of some monitors may have shown this image as too dark and a bit too cluttered because of the viewers lack of visibility.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Composition: I really like this image.  The composition is great and the movement of the ball excellent. Technical: The choice of desaturation is spot on...the fluoro colour really works well. Overall: The only thing I can put my finger on is the calibration of some monitors may have shown this image as too dark and a bit too cluttered because of the viewers lack of visibility.', '2007-06-01 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722697, 514531, 47906, '<td valign="top">I liked this image in the challenge, but thought the barn itself was a bit overprocessed, mostly because of the look on the roof. The roof IMO, is a bit flat and has a lack of texture that the shingles on it should give like on some parts of it.<br/> <br/>I did how ever understand that it was kind of what you were going for in the weathered look, and I liked alot of the other post processing techniques overall and I gave you a 6.<br/> <br/>Rich</td>', 'I liked this image in the challenge, but thought the barn itself was a bit overprocessed, mostly because of the look on the roof. The roof IMO, is a bit flat and has a lack of texture that the shingles on it should give like on some parts of it. I did how ever understand that it was kind of what you were going for in the weathered look, and I liked alot of the other post processing techniques overall and I gave you a 6. Rich', '2007-06-01 07:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3722752, 515936, 27133, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club.</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> Composition is good...the viewers eye is directed straight throught the image.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> The technicals have let you down.  The choice of the saturated area is quite weak compared to its surroundings.<br/> <br/><b>Overall:</b>I think this is a strong moody image....just not edited strongly enough for the challenge.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club.  Composition: Composition is good...the viewers eye is directed straight throught the image. Technical: The technicals have let you down.  The choice of the saturated area is quite weak compared to its surroundings. Overall:I think this is a strong moody image....just not edited strongly enough for the challenge.', '2007-06-01 08:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
