(3723192, 513371, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen so many of these heart shaped flowers - I need to get some!  Very pretty and vibrant color, great title!  Like the others, I think this should have scored higher!</td>', 'I''ve seen so many of these heart shaped flowers - I need to get some!  Very pretty and vibrant color, great title!  Like the others, I think this should have scored higher!', '2007-06-01 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3723233, 515471, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is a fun pic!  The color comes across well and almost blends in with the pic (as opposed to being too strong and out of place).  I love that you have the color going down her neck.  Great facial expression!</td>', 'This is a fun pic!  The color comes across well and almost blends in with the pic (as opposed to being too strong and out of place).  I love that you have the color going down her neck.  Great facial expression!', '2007-06-01 10:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3723244, 514272, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love animal-in-your-face shots.  His pose and the selective coloring make him (or her? lol)  kind of pop out of the pic.  Fun pic!</td>', 'I love animal-in-your-face shots.  His pose and the selective coloring make him (or her? lol)  kind of pop out of the pic.  Fun pic!', '2007-06-01 10:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3723262, 516405, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  I like this.  Love the geometry and the wall is intriguing.  And the tree leaves are a nice interception into the patterns.</td>', 'This is cool.  I like this.  Love the geometry and the wall is intriguing.  And the tree leaves are a nice interception into the patterns.', '2007-06-01 10:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3723484, 515967, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by purpleflutterby13:</b></div><hr/><i>(heh, except why is the portrait so damn happy? I always imagined it as falling apart from all that sin and debauchery :p ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, I noticed the same thing. It''s probably because, you know, most people smile in portaits!</td>', 'Originally posted by purpleflutterby13:(heh, except why is the portrait so damn happy? I always imagined it as falling apart from all that sin and debauchery :p )   Yeah, I noticed the same thing. It''s probably because, you know, most people smile in portaits!', '2007-06-01 11:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3723504, 515967, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh is this in reference to the Oscar Wilde novel which I don''t remember all that well now? (lol)  Love the opposing perspectives (model vs. photograph).  Similar shirt and ties - good balance!  Selective desat - a good way to highlight the beauty of the aging photo. Awesome - love pictures with meaning!<br/> <br/>Edit to add:  I don''t remember much about the story - did a little digging around to refresh my memory so what I am writing will probably not sound right, but it worked for me lol.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-01 10:16:26.</i></td>', 'Oh is this in reference to the Oscar Wilde novel which I don''t remember all that well now? (lol)  Love the opposing perspectives (model vs. photograph).  Similar shirt and ties - good balance!  Selective desat - a good way to highlight the beauty of the aging photo. Awesome - love pictures with meaning! Edit to add:  I don''t remember much about the story - did a little digging around to refresh my memory so what I am writing will probably not sound right, but it worked for me lol.', '2007-06-01 11:15:01.000000', '2007-06-01 11:16:26.000000', 0),
