(3723660, 515967, 53572, '<td valign="top">i do wish i''d reached this in my voting - the portrait of dorian gray is one of wilde''s most interesting works - and you have done it quite well.  it''s really too bad so few people here knew it.</td>', 'i do wish i''d reached this in my voting - the portrait of dorian gray is one of wilde''s most interesting works - and you have done it quite well.  it''s really too bad so few people here knew it.', '2007-06-01 11:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3723903, 515967, 62787, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by purpleflutterby13:</b></div><hr/><i>(heh, except why is the portrait so damn happy? I always imagined it as falling apart from all that sin and debauchery :p ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, I noticed the same thing. It''s probably because, you know, most people smile in portaits! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Could be a sinful, debauched smile maybe? :)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by purpleflutterby13:(heh, except why is the portrait so damn happy? I always imagined it as falling apart from all that sin and debauchery :p )   Yeah, I noticed the same thing. It''s probably because, you know, most people smile in portaits!   Could be a sinful, debauched smile maybe? :)', '2007-06-01 12:26:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3724085, 514974, 43400, '<td valign="top">Wow, Congratulations on this incredible capture. The tones and colors are right on!!</td>', 'Wow, Congratulations on this incredible capture. The tones and colors are right on!!', '2007-06-01 13:15:01.000000', NULL, 0),
