(3742803, 516411, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''d like to say excellent score coz it deserved one, but it appears the voters had no idea with this .. its an excellent photograph and i love your desat . the image is so sharp and clean ... excellent border as well ..:(:(</td>', 'i''d like to say excellent score coz it deserved one, but it appears the voters had no idea with this .. its an excellent photograph and i love your desat . the image is so sharp and clean ... excellent border as well ..:(:(', '2007-06-05 18:01:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3743062, 513636, 48227, '<td valign="top">first of all I''m so disappointed that this image scored so low.<br/>this was one of my favorites, I gave it 10. the image is full of charm,<br/>when I first saw it the first thing that came to my mind was that this must be somewhere in Europe. love the composition too, and you choose the right subjects to be desaturated. IMO so underrated.</td>', 'first of all I''m so disappointed that this image scored so low.this was one of my favorites, I gave it 10. the image is full of charm,when I first saw it the first thing that came to my mind was that this must be somewhere in Europe. love the composition too, and you choose the right subjects to be desaturated. IMO so underrated.', '2007-06-05 19:21:19.000000', NULL, 0),
